https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Oe76N0kUW3Q

1
00:02:48,775 --> 00:02:50,982
This is from Benaras.
It is authentic, from...

2
00:02:52,145 --> 00:02:52,964
... Sri Ram's era.

3
00:03:11,164 --> 00:03:13,177
What a lovely
market this is Gulbadan!

4
00:03:13,233 --> 00:03:16,031
I have never seen
anything like this in my life.

5
00:03:16,169 --> 00:03:19,036
This is the, Meena Bazaar'.

6
00:03:19,172 --> 00:03:23,063
This tradition of
putting up the Meena Bazaar,...

7
00:03:23,176 --> 00:03:27,067
was introduced by lt
takes place twice a month.

8
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:31,071
The daughters of the wealthy
decorate their shops with...

9
00:03:31,184 --> 00:03:35,075
... goods, and the
customers are generally...

10
00:03:35,188 --> 00:03:39,238
from the royal families,
of high esteem and status.

11
00:03:39,359 --> 00:03:44,103
Barring the king and princes, no
other man can enter the market.

12
00:03:44,197 --> 00:03:49,112
It often happens that many
princes come to buy things,...

13
00:03:49,202 --> 00:03:52,069
... but are instead taken
up by the beautiful women.

14
00:03:52,205 --> 00:03:55,584
I wish I was sold
off to prince Khurram.

15
00:03:57,130 --> 00:04:00,509
See young lady, this is
made by special artisans.

16
00:04:03,637 --> 00:04:06,333
Just see, how beautiful!

17
00:04:07,140 --> 00:04:08,983
Seems so real and authentic
as if it is going to speak out.

18
00:04:09,476 --> 00:04:12,001
I will present
this to prince Khurram.

19
00:04:22,195 --> 00:04:25,062
Oh no, Prince Sahriyar! I
thought of the beautiful...

20
00:04:25,198 --> 00:04:27,371
... peacock, but here
comes a crow instead!

21
00:04:27,534 --> 00:04:30,059
Come on lets go. If he
sees you, it'll be difficult...

22
00:04:30,203 --> 00:04:31,534
... to get rid of him. Come on.

23
00:04:33,206 --> 00:04:36,073
Dear - Please come here princess!
Look at these nice jewels...

24
00:04:36,209 --> 00:04:38,052
...of Chandan(coloured rare
stones). I also have anklets,...

25
00:04:38,211 --> 00:04:40,566
...and armlets and
pair of rare bangles.

26
00:04:40,613 --> 00:04:42,558
Look at this nine
stringed rare necklace.

27
00:04:42,615 --> 00:04:45,072
The person who wears
this will have the whole...

28
00:04:45,218 --> 00:04:48,085
...world swooning at her feet.

29
00:04:48,221 --> 00:04:54,160
This,,King' of all necklaces
is saying that,if his destiny...

30
00:04:54,187 --> 00:05:00,126
...makes him adorn the neck of
his beloved', the whole world...

31
00:05:00,193 --> 00:05:02,036
... would become envious of him.

32
00:05:15,375 --> 00:05:16,012
O God!

33
00:05:26,219 --> 00:05:30,110
Your majesty, the prince, please
accept this from your maid.

34
00:05:30,223 --> 00:05:33,260
That lady, who touched
this necklace, who was she?.

35
00:05:33,293 --> 00:05:37,115
She is the daughter of
the prime minister, Asif Khan.

36
00:05:39,566 --> 00:05:45,152
She's so beautiful, like
brilliant light, and so heavenly.

37
00:05:47,407 --> 00:05:51,127
Please send this gift on
my behalf to Arjuman Banoo.

38
00:05:52,245 --> 00:05:53,394
As you say, your majesty!

39
00:05:54,414 --> 00:05:58,464
Prince Khurram, I have
specially chosen this for you.

40
00:06:01,421 --> 00:06:10,261
Beautiful, the brilliant face,
the most melodious voice.

41
00:06:10,263 --> 00:06:13,300
- Were you saying something?.
- I was praising it's beauty.

42
00:06:13,333 --> 00:06:17,155
There are so many like these.
The shops are full of them.

43
00:06:17,270 --> 00:06:19,283
Come with me,
I'll show you. Come!

44
00:06:24,344 --> 00:06:28,166
Banoo, someone has
sent this gift for you.

45
00:06:28,281 --> 00:06:30,124
I don't accept
gifts from strangers.

46
00:06:30,283 --> 00:06:33,320
He wasn't a stranger,
he was Prince Khurram.

47
00:06:36,456 --> 00:06:39,493
So, now you couldn't
be having any objection?.

48
00:06:40,293 --> 00:06:44,184
- Please accept them now. - So,
what if he is prince Khurram?.

49
00:06:44,297 --> 00:06:46,140
Who does he think I am?.

50
00:06:46,299 --> 00:06:48,824
Well he must have liked you,
that's why he sent this gift.

51
00:06:49,976 --> 00:06:52,183
- Take it back! - What!

52
00:06:52,345 --> 00:06:53,334
I said take it back.

53
00:06:59,419 --> 00:07:02,900
What does this
smile of yours indicate?.

54
00:07:03,356 --> 00:07:05,711
A new flower is
going to bloom very soon!

55
00:07:05,758 --> 00:07:06,838
What kind of a flower?.

56
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:11,251
The love story of prince
Khurram and Arjuman Banoo.

57
00:07:11,364 --> 00:07:13,377
What is this you are saying?.

58
00:07:13,533 --> 00:07:17,253
Empress Noorjehan's daughter,
Ladli Banno, is obsessed...

59
00:07:17,370 --> 00:07:18,519
... with Prince Khurram.

60
00:07:19,005 --> 00:07:21,212
- She may be obsessed. - So,
now what will happen?.

61
00:07:22,375 --> 00:07:26,266
A war between Empress
Noorjehan, and Prince Khurram.

62
00:07:38,554 --> 00:07:42,786
,Your beauty in real life,
is not seen in your painting'.

63
00:07:44,560 --> 00:07:48,451
Prince Khurram, the Emperor
has sent a message as to...

64
00:07:48,564 --> 00:07:50,737
... why you didn't
appear in the court today?.

65
00:07:50,900 --> 00:07:55,974
-I hope you are not feeling
ill. -Of course not, I am fine.

66
00:07:56,584 --> 00:08:00,816
, I was so carefree and
bereft of this pain of love'.

67
00:08:01,222 --> 00:08:05,818
,Those where great days, when
I was not enamoured by anyone'

68
00:08:06,928 --> 00:08:09,453
The master has asked, why
haven't you eaten anything...

69
00:08:09,597 --> 00:08:10,586
... since the morning?.

70
00:08:16,604 --> 00:08:19,129
O God! Banoo, l
hope all is well.

71
00:08:19,607 --> 00:08:26,911
Well, I am feeling a
little good, and a little bad!

72
00:08:28,249 --> 00:08:30,797
,She has touched my heart'

73
00:08:31,619 --> 00:08:33,462
Your highness Ladli
Banoo has asked about you.

74
00:08:33,621 --> 00:08:37,512
- Thank her for inquiring.
- Sir she has said...

75
00:08:37,625 --> 00:08:41,857
Go from here, just go! I don't
know what's happened to everyone.

76
00:08:41,863 --> 00:08:44,479
The one whose message l
am waiting for, hasn't come.

77
00:08:44,632 --> 00:08:46,805
While others keep
on sending messages.

78
00:08:47,635 --> 00:08:52,550
Your highness tell
a message from her.

79
00:08:55,276 --> 00:08:58,689
O Gulbadan, it's you!
Please come, and sit down!

80
00:08:59,814 --> 00:09:03,534
- How are you feeling?.
- I am fine!

81
00:09:03,651 --> 00:09:06,518
- Tell me, what can I do?. -
Sir, it's our duty to serve.

82
00:09:06,654 --> 00:09:11,057
Listen, that necklace,...
hands of that lady?.

83
00:09:11,018 --> 00:09:13,816
- Yes, I did give
it to her. - Then what?.

84
00:09:14,622 --> 00:09:17,079
She said that she doesn't
take gifts from strangers...

85
00:09:17,125 --> 00:09:18,114
... and she returned it.

86
00:09:18,626 --> 00:09:20,184
O no, this
shouldn't have happened.

87
00:09:20,261 --> 00:09:23,503
However, the manner in which
she refused seemed to be more...

88
00:09:23,631 --> 00:09:27,522
... of an acceptance, and that
too, with a heart full of love.

89
00:09:27,356 --> 00:09:30,223
You are so nice Gulbadan.

90
00:09:30,359 --> 00:09:33,567
I swear, I would have died
had you not said these words.

91
00:09:33,596 --> 00:09:35,700
Just wait here! Just
wait here, my saviour!

92
00:09:47,710 --> 00:09:50,406
Here, this is a pigeon for her.

93
00:09:50,446 --> 00:09:52,903
I will be indebted to
you the rest of my life.

94
00:09:55,718 --> 00:09:59,256
If you so desire, should l
reveal what is in your heart?.

95
00:09:59,388 --> 00:10:02,596
Definitely! But,
praise me a little extra.

96
00:10:00,813 --> 00:10:01,450
Your wish is my command.

97
00:10:04,550 --> 00:10:10,420
- Banoo, may your
maid enter?. - No! No! No!

98
00:10:11,390 --> 00:10:15,383
Alright. I came here
because the prince has sent me.

99
00:10:15,394 --> 00:10:16,144
I'll go now.

100
00:10:16,829 --> 00:10:22,901
Who is it?. Gulbadan,
just listen. Wait! Wait!

101
00:10:22,901 --> 00:10:26,382
Well Banoo, why is your
behaviour so changed today?.

102
00:10:26,405 --> 00:10:30,557
Well, it's nothing.
Just like that.

103
00:10:29,936 --> 00:10:30,755
Come on.

104
00:10:32,939 --> 00:10:36,659
Come and sit down.
What should I do for you?.

105
00:10:37,610 --> 00:10:42,866
- What can you do Banoo?.
- So what brings you here?.

106
00:10:42,909 --> 00:10:46,447
The royal prince's
condition is so pitiable, Banoo.

107
00:10:46,579 --> 00:10:47,398
Why?.

108
00:10:47,580 --> 00:10:50,447
From the time you have
returned his gift, his heart...

109
00:10:50,583 --> 00:10:51,914
... is completely broken.

110
00:10:52,085 --> 00:10:55,805
He is neither, eating,
drinking, talking, or smiling.

111
00:10:56,089 --> 00:10:57,750
His condition is so pitiable.

112
00:10:58,758 --> 00:11:02,478
If you think that I have
hurt him, then you go ask for...

113
00:11:02,595 --> 00:11:04,608
... forgiveness, on my behalf.

114
00:11:04,664 --> 00:11:05,585
No, I won't do that.

115
00:11:06,232 --> 00:11:09,645
Why don't you
accept his second gift?.

116
00:11:09,769 --> 00:11:12,465
He said that the first gift
was lifeless, so it didn't...

117
00:11:12,605 --> 00:11:15,472
... say anything, but this
gift is full of life, and...

118
00:11:15,608 --> 00:11:18,475
... if you refuse to accept it
then the poor thing will not...

119
00:11:18,611 --> 00:11:19,942
... be able to bear it.

120
00:11:21,614 --> 00:11:24,139
- I have not
understood you. - Just wait!

121
00:11:32,625 --> 00:11:35,492
- A pigeon! - Yes, a pigeon!

122
00:11:35,628 --> 00:11:37,471
Now, with your delicate hands
write a letter, and ask for...

123
00:11:37,630 --> 00:11:38,961
... forgiveness.

124
00:11:39,632 --> 00:11:42,669
This mute pigeon will
bring two hearts together.

125
00:11:43,803 --> 00:11:45,464
Don't tell this to anyone.

126
00:11:45,638 --> 00:11:47,811
You better warn your
eyes not to give you away.

127
00:11:47,874 --> 00:11:50,843
- I'll not tell this to anyone.
- You are very naughty!

128
00:11:50,877 --> 00:11:51,445
Please accept this!

129
00:12:25,845 --> 00:12:34,002
'The charm that you have is
not there in your picture.'

130
00:12:52,705 --> 00:12:58,644
'Your image was
captured in colors.'

131
00:12:58,711 --> 00:13:01,578
'You could not be
captured in colors though.'

132
00:13:01,714 --> 00:13:04,581
'The warmth of your breath,
the fragrance..

133
00:13:04,717 --> 00:13:09,973
..'of your body
could not be captured.'

134
00:13:10,723 --> 00:13:24,865
The charms in your movement are
not there in my poetry.'

135
00:13:46,092 --> 00:13:55,101
'Where is the poetry of
motion in a lifeless beauty??'

136
00:13:55,101 --> 00:13:59,151
'There is neither
the charm of accent..'

137
00:13:59,171 --> 00:14:02,811
'.. nor the charm of dissent.'

138
00:14:03,843 --> 00:14:18,941
'There is no trap of silky
hair on the road of the traveler.'

139
00:14:41,814 --> 00:14:50,823
'There is nothing
in the world like you.'

140
00:14:50,784 --> 00:14:58,771
'Please let me see
you just once more.'

141
00:15:34,423 --> 00:15:36,630
Good work, Bahadur!

142
00:15:36,792 --> 00:15:40,000
Today, messages are
coming again and again.

143
00:15:40,029 --> 00:15:42,998
It seems that both of us are
really pining for each other.

144
00:15:44,967 --> 00:15:50,041
, Respected prince, I do not
have much freedom to go about'.

145
00:15:50,306 --> 00:15:54,709
, Please accept my helplessness!
Arjuman!'

146
00:15:54,810 --> 00:15:59,725
Arjuman Banoo, if you only
understood how helpless I am too.

147
00:16:00,816 --> 00:16:04,195
Bagh Bahadur, Tell her,
I am longing for her.

148
00:16:08,824 --> 00:16:14,763
,Why are you so
in my life again??'

149
00:16:14,830 --> 00:16:20,769
, I want to see you once more
if you have pity on me then...

150
00:16:20,836 --> 00:16:23,703
... today evening, at the shore
of the river Jamuna, please...

151
00:16:23,839 --> 00:16:25,852
... meet me in the Baradari'.

152
00:16:25,908 --> 00:16:30,060
, My eyes will await
you impatiently. Khurram'.

153
00:16:30,079 --> 00:16:30,829
O God!

154
00:16:57,873 --> 00:17:07,883
'Let the flowers touch your
feet it will be your mercy.'

155
00:17:07,883 --> 00:17:17,929
'Otherwise, not only me,
but they too will complain.'

156
00:17:23,065 --> 00:17:29,857
'The flowers which you spread,
I will walk on them.'

157
00:17:39,248 --> 00:17:48,941
'l fear if this will
be an insult of love.'

158
00:17:55,931 --> 00:18:02,211
'Please have mercy on the
restless hopes of the heart.'

159
00:18:08,944 --> 00:18:22,062
'lf you walk so slowly,
there will surely be Armageddon.'

160
00:18:36,305 --> 00:18:42,926
'Shame stops me,
here, love pushes me here.'

161
00:18:49,151 --> 00:19:02,098
What did I know that the
heart would be in such a state??'

162
00:19:10,339 --> 00:19:16,960
'One shows shame to
strangers and not to close ones.'

163
00:19:23,185 --> 00:19:33,049
'lf you show shame in front
of me, it will be a problem.'

164
00:19:49,657 --> 00:19:57,644
Banoo, I am very fortunate
that you gave so much respect...

165
00:19:57,665 --> 00:20:04,798
... to these flowers and
touched them to your eyes.

166
00:20:05,673 --> 00:20:08,540
They were flowers
that is why I did this.

167
00:20:08,676 --> 00:20:11,884
If in place of flowers, l
had placed myself there, then?.

168
00:20:12,680 --> 00:20:14,853
I would have respectfully given
a place to you too, in my eyes.

169
00:20:16,017 --> 00:20:16,494
O God!

170
00:20:19,687 --> 00:20:21,530
You have given the answer
to the emotions of my heart...

171
00:20:21,689 --> 00:20:23,862
... with your
delicate pulsating heart beats.

172
00:20:24,692 --> 00:20:30,631
- I am grateful to you.
- Even, I am grateful.

173
00:20:33,034 --> 00:20:39,826
- You must be tired, please
sit down! - No, it's very late.

174
00:20:41,169 --> 00:20:42,158
I have to go.

175
00:20:42,236 --> 00:20:45,876
I have been waiting for so
long. This meeting is so short.

176
00:20:46,307 --> 00:20:49,549
How will I spend my
time waiting for you?.

177
00:20:50,678 --> 00:20:52,179
How will I live
without you Banoo?.

178
00:20:53,681 --> 00:20:57,572
How were you living
till now?. - fallen in love.

179
00:20:58,019 --> 00:21:01,557
So, when did you fall in love?.

180
00:21:01,689 --> 00:21:06,763
The very first time I saw you,
I was madly in love.

181
00:21:07,695 --> 00:21:10,562
I am in love, but much more.
It is like a disease, and...

182
00:21:10,698 --> 00:21:11,517
... only you can treat me.

183
00:21:11,699 --> 00:21:12,518
Only you can treat me.

184
00:21:14,202 --> 00:21:18,764
Then you too have the
same and I am helpless.

185
00:21:18,773 --> 00:21:19,523
Helpless!

186
00:21:20,708 --> 00:21:25,623
Yes, like you, I am helpless
too. Atleast he said what was...

187
00:21:25,695 --> 00:21:29,586
... in his heart, but l
couldn't even say that.

188
00:21:29,699 --> 00:21:30,518
Beautiful!

189
00:21:31,868 --> 00:21:35,588
These tantalizing eyes and
endearing looks, which can...

190
00:21:35,705 --> 00:21:38,572
... make an angel, pine for you.

191
00:21:38,708 --> 00:21:40,551
So what can one say
about human beings!

192
00:21:40,710 --> 00:21:41,529
Let me go now.

193
00:21:42,345 --> 00:21:45,587
Before you go, atleast tell
me when will we meet again?.

194
00:21:46,716 --> 00:21:48,559
Whenever you call me. -
Tomorrow is the Meena Bazaar...

195
00:21:48,718 --> 00:21:50,049
... please come there.

196
00:21:50,887 --> 00:21:54,095
If this is your command
I will definitely come.

197
00:21:59,896 --> 00:22:05,152
Listen, may God be with you.

198
00:22:10,740 --> 00:22:14,631
Ladli Banoo can that
the person you dream...

199
00:22:14,744 --> 00:22:20,149
about day and night, he starts
to dream about some one else.

200
00:22:20,149 --> 00:22:24,995
No, this cannot be. I
will not let this happen.

201
00:22:25,388 --> 00:22:26,571
Respected mother.

202
00:22:26,756 --> 00:22:30,294
What is the matter?. Why is my
darling daughter so perturbed.

203
00:22:30,326 --> 00:22:33,124
Mother, just see
what Gulbadan is saying.

204
00:22:34,764 --> 00:22:38,996
Arjuman Banoo has enchanted
prince Khurram with her love.

205
00:22:39,102 --> 00:22:44,688
Prince Khurram and Arjuman,
what is this you are saying?.

206
00:22:44,774 --> 00:22:48,153
I am telling you empress,
what I've seen with my own eyes.

207
00:22:48,278 --> 00:22:51,657
I do not believe it.
You must have seen a dream.

208
00:22:51,781 --> 00:22:54,648
If you want to see if
it is real or a dream...

209
00:22:54,784 --> 00:22:58,675
... see it tomorrow with
your eyes, in the Meena Bazaar.

210
00:22:58,788 --> 00:23:03,020
Arjuman banoo will be there
tomorrow, and Prince Khurram too.

211
00:23:11,775 --> 00:23:17,202
I have all sorts of goods.
Please buy from me.

212
00:23:18,782 --> 00:23:26,769
- Banoo, who are you
waiting for?. - For no one.

213
00:23:34,391 --> 00:23:36,598
- It's you. -
Ladli Banoo, I am sorry.

214
00:23:36,760 --> 00:23:37,749
Alright, I forgive you.

215
00:23:37,928 --> 00:23:40,101
But where are you
going in such a great hurry?.

216
00:23:40,764 --> 00:23:42,937
No where special, I was looking
around in the Meena Bazaar.

217
00:23:43,100 --> 00:23:46,137
It's not interesting to go
about alone, come along with me.

218
00:23:49,106 --> 00:23:49,925
Please come.

219
00:23:54,151 --> 00:23:59,737
Welcome prince, welcome banoo,
this special thing is for you.

220
00:23:59,823 --> 00:24:03,714
Sir, this is that scarf
which is meant for Laila.

221
00:24:03,827 --> 00:24:05,670
This is that special type
of scarf which Majnu saw...

222
00:24:05,829 --> 00:24:07,672
... Laila in and
was smitten by Laila.

223
00:24:07,831 --> 00:24:09,674
Why don't you
buy it Ladli Banoo?.

224
00:24:09,833 --> 00:24:12,188
May be you too will
become the legendary Laila.

225
00:24:12,235 --> 00:24:18,447
May your words come true. Give
it to me, You see, I'll wear it.

226
00:24:24,848 --> 00:24:32,152
I have flowers like the Juhi,
begum they are like stars.

227
00:24:33,190 --> 00:24:37,081
The eyes are so angry and
there is a sword in the hands.

228
00:24:37,861 --> 00:24:45,848
I am sure, you have
a fight with someone.

229
00:25:02,012 --> 00:25:05,732
- You have taken so long to
come - I would have come earlier...

230
00:25:05,849 --> 00:25:07,692
... but one cat crossed my way.

231
00:25:07,851 --> 00:25:15,492
I had so many doubts in my
mind, desires and wishes, were...

232
00:25:15,492 --> 00:25:16,675
... getting restless.

233
00:25:16,860 --> 00:25:18,361
Please forgive me Banno.

234
00:25:18,862 --> 00:25:24,801
I didn't ever dream that you
would be waiting so impatiently.

235
00:25:25,202 --> 00:25:29,764
Prince, there are so many
desires which if I want...

236
00:25:29,873 --> 00:25:32,398
... to hold back,
I cannot do so.

237
00:25:33,877 --> 00:25:38,280
There are so many aspirations
which just stay within the heart.

238
00:25:39,883 --> 00:25:45,822
God has made our love so strong
that she lives in my heart...

239
00:25:46,210 --> 00:25:49,247
... and I live in her heart.

240
00:25:51,282 --> 00:25:56,640
Take guard, it's my turn.
Well, I have saved myself.

241
00:25:56,721 --> 00:26:04,366
- Really, now try to save
again. - Oh no, I have lost.

242
00:26:06,564 --> 00:26:08,065
That is because you
were playing the wrong move.

243
00:26:08,232 --> 00:26:11,611
What is the matter,
you never lose so easily.

244
00:26:12,737 --> 00:26:15,262
I will one day take
revenge for this defeat.

245
00:26:17,875 --> 00:26:18,728
You are more than welcome.

246
00:26:20,244 --> 00:26:22,087
I have won in love but
even then I have lost...

247
00:26:22,246 --> 00:26:23,577
... everything to you.

248
00:26:24,882 --> 00:26:30,172
Emperor, do you remember
when you lost, at that time, l...

249
00:26:30,254 --> 00:26:33,633
... had a small girl in my lap.

250
00:26:34,556 --> 00:26:38,094
You had put your hand on her
head and promised, that you...

251
00:26:38,226 --> 00:26:41,434
... would marry your
dearest son with her.

252
00:26:42,230 --> 00:26:43,731
Well, what do you want to say?.

253
00:26:45,233 --> 00:26:49,124
I want to ask you, who is
is the most dearest person...

254
00:26:49,237 --> 00:26:50,738
... in your life to you.

255
00:26:51,239 --> 00:26:54,106
Every son is dear to his father.

256
00:26:54,242 --> 00:26:59,157
But Khurram is full of
bravery and sagacity and so...

257
00:26:59,247 --> 00:27:01,090
... he is the most dear to me.

258
00:27:01,249 --> 00:27:05,140
What a happy event will it
be in our lives if Khurram...

259
00:27:05,253 --> 00:27:08,290
... and Ladli Banoo
are married to each other.

260
00:27:08,323 --> 00:27:10,609
Your idea is very good.

261
00:27:11,259 --> 00:27:14,126
But before I take any decision,
it is important...

262
00:27:14,262 --> 00:27:17,470
... that I find out the
feelings of Khurram too.

263
00:27:18,266 --> 00:27:21,133
If Khurram
thinks differently....

264
00:27:22,270 --> 00:27:25,478
Maybe my commitment to justice
would make me break my promise.

265
00:27:25,507 --> 00:27:26,428
Emperor!

266
00:27:30,278 --> 00:27:36,217
I am not only the father of
Khurram but an emperor, and...

267
00:27:36,284 --> 00:27:38,127
... without giving this a
thought I cannot afford to...

268
00:27:38,286 --> 00:27:41,153
... give my permission which
may not do justice, and might...

269
00:27:41,289 --> 00:27:42,620
... be a blot on my ability.

270
00:27:51,316 --> 00:27:55,207
My royal prince,
please accept my greetings.

271
00:27:56,321 --> 00:28:02,772
,Today at the same courtyard
after sunset, I'll wait for you'

272
00:28:03,962 --> 00:28:06,169
,Yours Arjuman'.

273
00:28:09,334 --> 00:28:14,249
Be alert and stand
respectfully, the empress...

274
00:28:14,339 --> 00:28:16,694
... Noorjehan is arriving.

275
00:28:26,351 --> 00:28:30,242
Empress, I am surprised to
see a lady of your eminence...

276
00:28:30,355 --> 00:28:34,246
... come to my humble home.
Please sit down.

277
00:28:34,359 --> 00:28:36,202
What brings you here?.

278
00:28:36,361 --> 00:28:41,276
Empress Noorjehan has not
come to the home of the prime...

279
00:28:41,366 --> 00:28:45,257
... minister, Asif Khan, but
a sister has come to the home...

280
00:28:45,370 --> 00:28:46,189
... of her dear brother.

281
00:28:46,371 --> 00:28:49,238
My eyes are so delighted and
my heart so full of happiness.

282
00:28:49,374 --> 00:28:55,313
I see the Empress Noorjehan
everyday, but I am meeting...

283
00:28:55,380 --> 00:28:58,247
... my sister
Mehrunissa after so many years.

284
00:28:58,550 --> 00:29:00,211
There is so much difference
between the two of them.

285
00:29:00,385 --> 00:29:04,276
Wearing the crown does change
ones outlook, but the heart...

286
00:29:04,309 --> 00:29:05,298
... never changes.

287
00:29:05,377 --> 00:29:08,175
May god let these feelings
always nurture inside you.

288
00:29:08,313 --> 00:29:12,545
- Where is my beautiful doll,
Arjuman?. - I'll just call her.

289
00:29:21,326 --> 00:29:23,339
Please accept the greetings
of your subject, empress.

290
00:29:23,395 --> 00:29:27,217
May god bless you.
Come and sit near me.

291
00:29:31,336 --> 00:29:34,203
She has really grown up.
Have you thought about...

292
00:29:34,339 --> 00:29:35,328
... her future brother?.

293
00:29:35,674 --> 00:29:38,711
Where do I have the time?.
she would have....

294
00:29:38,844 --> 00:29:42,223
So what if she doesn't have
a mother, I am always there...

295
00:29:42,307 --> 00:29:43,638
... to think about my doll.

296
00:29:43,708 --> 00:29:48,213
From today, she will stay
in my palace and I will look...

297
00:29:48,313 --> 00:29:52,204
My daughter is very fortunate.
big worry of mine.

298
00:29:52,317 --> 00:29:57,573
I will never forget
this favour. - lts my duty.

299
00:29:58,323 --> 00:30:00,678
Get ready, you will
have to come with me.

300
00:30:04,329 --> 00:30:08,220
You are fortunate that you'll
get a mother's love once again.

301
00:30:11,155 --> 00:30:14,534
She has promised
to come after sunset.

302
00:30:14,792 --> 00:30:19,058
Sun, for Gods's sake,
why don't you go down?.

303
00:30:35,680 --> 00:30:38,035
What is this nonsense?.
What do you mean by this?.

304
00:31:51,589 --> 00:31:57,828
'You will have to
keep your promise.'

305
00:31:57,828 --> 00:32:02,162
'Whether the world or
God himself stops you.'

306
00:32:02,266 --> 00:32:06,157
'You will have to come,
O beloved.'

307
00:32:24,288 --> 00:32:36,382
'The thirsty eyes have called;
the roads of love have called.'

308
00:32:39,303 --> 00:32:43,194
'O the life of
coyness and life and charm.'

309
00:32:43,268 --> 00:32:49,207
Don't trouble me,
you will have to come.'

310
00:32:55,280 --> 00:33:01,219
'l accept that I will
have to leave this world..'

311
00:33:01,620 --> 00:33:05,158
..'Understand this,
whenever you..'

312
00:33:05,290 --> 00:33:10,205
'.. remember me, l
will have to come.'

313
00:33:26,645 --> 00:33:32,231
'l will not take
accusations on my loyalty.'

314
00:33:32,317 --> 00:33:38,256
'l have given you my heart.
I'll give you my life too.'

315
00:33:41,326 --> 00:33:48,289
'When we have dealt with love,
how can we be scared??'

316
00:33:48,333 --> 00:33:55,574
'The promise that I have made,
I will have to keep it.'

317
00:33:55,574 --> 00:33:57,519
'l will have to come.'

318
00:34:05,517 --> 00:34:11,285
'Till the time the
moon and the stars shine..

319
00:34:11,356 --> 00:34:17,295
..'the promises of our
love will not be broken.'

320
00:34:20,365 --> 00:34:30,570
'We will have to become
crazy for each other and come.'

321
00:34:41,640 --> 00:34:43,653
Why did you take so
long to come Banoo?.

322
00:34:44,309 --> 00:34:46,834
Will this tradition of love
never change, for those in love.

323
00:34:46,878 --> 00:34:49,164
While I long to meet you.
You love to make me wait.

324
00:34:49,314 --> 00:34:53,205
This is not so prince. A
wall has been built in...

325
00:34:53,318 --> 00:34:54,307
... our path of love.

326
00:34:54,653 --> 00:34:57,520
A wall! Who has
tried to do this?.

327
00:34:57,956 --> 00:35:01,198
That I don't know. Today the
Empress suddenly came and took...

328
00:35:01,326 --> 00:35:03,851
... me to her
palace as her guest.

329
00:35:03,895 --> 00:35:04,645
Then what happened?.

330
00:35:04,729 --> 00:35:08,210
As I was about to come, I found
myself surrounded by the guards.

331
00:35:10,375 --> 00:35:13,583
That means that our
love is no longer a secret.

332
00:35:14,459 --> 00:35:17,838
The empress has got
the news of our meetings.

333
00:35:18,096 --> 00:35:20,303
So why did she put
the guards to surround me?.

334
00:35:20,505 --> 00:35:22,348
Besides her who has
the courage to do this.

335
00:35:22,507 --> 00:35:24,350
She is the only one who can
treat the daughter of the...

336
00:35:24,509 --> 00:35:27,376
...the prime minister like this
and even try to put a guard...

337
00:35:27,512 --> 00:35:30,379
and keep a watch, on the heir
of the empire, prince Khurram.

338
00:35:30,435 --> 00:35:33,814
But why has she done this?. What
enmity does she have with me?.

339
00:35:33,798 --> 00:35:36,255
Her enmity is not with
you Banno, but it is with me.

340
00:35:36,401 --> 00:35:37,220
Why?.

341
00:35:37,402 --> 00:35:42,317
She wants Ladli
Banno empress of lndia.

342
00:35:42,741 --> 00:35:45,266
But this plan of
hers will never succeed.

343
00:35:45,410 --> 00:35:51,349
It is not easy to challenge
her, prince. I am scared that...

344
00:35:51,416 --> 00:35:56,331
... she might separate us
forever, from each other.

345
00:35:56,508 --> 00:36:01,252
I take an oath on that sacred
honour which lovers stand by.

346
00:36:01,346 --> 00:36:05,237
Banoo, we will keep meeting,
in this place and, will...

347
00:36:05,350 --> 00:36:06,851
... continue meeting so.

348
00:36:07,352 --> 00:36:08,171
Prince!

349
00:36:09,394 --> 00:36:14,309
Let's forget our
pain and beautiful...

350
00:36:14,399 --> 00:36:19,473
... night, let us smile together
with the stars shining up there.

351
00:36:20,405 --> 00:36:21,554
This shining moon.

352
00:36:22,908 --> 00:36:27,311
This beautiful garden and the
shore of the river Jamuna,...

353
00:36:28,747 --> 00:36:34,333
what a glorious view is this!
What a beautiful place is this.

354
00:36:36,588 --> 00:36:41,844
Prince, if I die then
make my tomb in this place.

355
00:36:42,060 --> 00:36:43,584
Don't say this, Banoo.

356
00:36:45,430 --> 00:36:49,321
I'll get such a magnificent
palace made here, which will...

357
00:36:49,434 --> 00:36:52,813
... be
incomparable in the world.

358
00:36:53,438 --> 00:36:58,353
Yes, it should be made of
marble like a beautiful flower.

359
00:36:55,878 --> 00:36:58,745
In which the fragrance
of our love will be spread.

360
00:36:58,881 --> 00:37:04,820
Which, in such a moonlit night,
will shine like our love.

361
00:37:04,887 --> 00:37:09,290
It will show the moon in the sky,
the reflection of its beauty.

362
00:37:09,892 --> 00:37:14,454
Prince Khurram, you will
make such a palace, won't you?.

363
00:37:14,463 --> 00:37:17,079
Banoo, I have already made
it's foundation in my heart.

364
00:37:17,400 --> 00:37:19,755
The picture of that palace is
already taking shape in my heart.

365
00:37:19,902 --> 00:37:23,793
One day, I will take the
dream out of my heart and...

366
00:37:23,906 --> 00:37:27,114
... make it stand near
the shore of the Jamuna.

367
00:37:27,243 --> 00:37:29,768
Then the whole world will
shine with the light and...

368
00:37:29,912 --> 00:37:31,413
... glory of our love.

369
00:37:32,915 --> 00:37:34,928
- Prince. - Banoo.

370
00:37:47,096 --> 00:37:53,194
Thank god so much, for
having saved my esteem.

371
00:37:58,941 --> 00:37:59,760
Empress!

372
00:38:02,278 --> 00:38:06,840
The path you are going
on has only thorns in it.

373
00:38:06,949 --> 00:38:09,304
I do not understand, empress.

374
00:38:10,352 --> 00:38:13,833
Do not try to hide anything.
I have seen everything with...

375
00:38:13,956 --> 00:38:16,993
... my own eyes
in the Meena Bazaar.

376
00:38:17,960 --> 00:38:22,192
Right now where are you
coming from, I know this too.

377
00:38:23,199 --> 00:38:25,815
Do not go so far ahead on
this road of love, so that...

378
00:38:25,968 --> 00:38:27,981
... it is
difficult for you to return.

379
00:38:28,971 --> 00:38:33,886
Those who tread this path
do not come back, Empress.

380
00:38:33,976 --> 00:38:36,843
You impudent girl! Do
not forget what you are!

381
00:38:36,979 --> 00:38:41,382
I can give you everything
for getting out of my way.

382
00:38:41,617 --> 00:38:46,907
What can you give me empress?.
Instead, you are asking me!

383
00:38:46,989 --> 00:38:52,416
I know Arjuman,
empress of lndia.

384
00:38:52,995 --> 00:38:55,862
What will I do
becoming the empress of lndia?.

385
00:38:56,165 --> 00:38:59,885
I Apologize, The empress of lndia,
right now, is herself standing...

386
00:39:00,002 --> 00:39:02,869
...in front of an ordinary
girl asking her for something.

387
00:39:06,008 --> 00:39:09,899
You have seen my kindness.
You have not seen how hard...

388
00:39:10,012 --> 00:39:11,343
... and vicious I can be.

389
00:39:12,648 --> 00:39:14,855
The love that you are so
proud of, I can crush him under...

390
00:39:15,017 --> 00:39:16,860
... my feet and destroy him.

391
00:39:17,019 --> 00:39:19,886
Empress, history is witness
to the fact that regimes have...

392
00:39:20,022 --> 00:39:22,889
... given in to legends of
love, while love has never...

393
00:39:23,025 --> 00:39:25,892
... Iost or bowed
down in front of regimes.

394
00:39:26,028 --> 00:39:29,919
Quiet! I give you a last chance.
Get out of my way, and for...

395
00:39:30,032 --> 00:39:32,899
... this I am ready
to give you anything.

396
00:39:34,036 --> 00:39:36,903
Besides Khurram, I can get
you married to any other prince.

397
00:39:33,065 --> 00:39:35,238
I can give you
land and any district.

398
00:39:36,068 --> 00:39:39,105
Tell me what you want?.

399
00:39:40,406 --> 00:39:43,944
This same question, had
once come in front of you too.

400
00:39:45,077 --> 00:39:48,968
When you loved Prince Salim,
this was the same question...

401
00:39:49,081 --> 00:39:51,606
... which the Emperor
Akbar had put to you.

402
00:39:52,585 --> 00:39:58,012
Tell me empress, which land
did you ask for, and which...

403
00:39:58,090 --> 00:39:59,933
... district did you want?.

404
00:40:00,092 --> 00:40:02,959
Except for Salim, which
prince did you pine for?.

405
00:40:03,095 --> 00:40:05,962
Arjuman, you are
going beyond limits.

406
00:40:06,098 --> 00:40:08,965
Your obsession for becoming
the empress of lndia, has even...

407
00:40:09,101 --> 00:40:09,920
... made you forget yourself.

408
00:40:10,102 --> 00:40:13,993
No, it's the Empress, who
has forgotten herself, when...

409
00:40:14,106 --> 00:40:15,607
... she became Noorjehan.

410
00:40:16,275 --> 00:40:18,448
She has forgotten Mehrunissa!

411
00:40:18,744 --> 00:40:21,986
I request you to decide
about me and the prince,...

412
00:40:22,114 --> 00:40:27,519
... as Mehrunissa would have,
and not as empress Noorjehan.

413
00:40:27,519 --> 00:40:31,512
Do not treat me in had treated
you by emporor Akaber..

414
00:40:31,624 --> 00:40:36,027
Emperor had done what he
had to, and I too will do...

415
00:40:36,008 --> 00:40:37,851
... what I have to do.

416
00:40:38,010 --> 00:40:42,060
Remember Arjuman,...
possible for my daughter.

417
00:40:42,348 --> 00:40:47,263
Even I am your daughter. I
am your brother's daughter.

418
00:40:48,020 --> 00:40:50,887
Every daughter is
the empresses' daughter.

419
00:40:51,150 --> 00:40:54,358
Do not sacrifice one
daughter for another.

420
00:40:54,987 --> 00:40:57,854
So you refuse completely.
May be, you are not aware...

421
00:40:57,990 --> 00:40:59,491
... of the consequences.

422
00:40:59,625 --> 00:41:03,550
People who love, never think
about the consequences, empress.

423
00:41:04,997 --> 00:41:05,816
You are great.

424
00:41:22,310 --> 00:41:25,177
Why is there so much laughter
and joy in Mumtaz Mahal's Palace?.

425
00:41:25,313 --> 00:41:29,204
To celebrate her birthday,...
organised a gathering...

426
00:41:29,317 --> 00:41:32,525
... of eminent poets. - Good.

427
00:41:33,321 --> 00:41:36,188
Prince Khurram will
be the special invitee.

428
00:41:36,324 --> 00:41:41,580
- What about prince Shariyar?. -
If you wish, we can invite him.

429
00:41:42,330 --> 00:41:45,197
But your presence
emperor, is very important.

430
00:41:42,813 --> 00:41:45,680
Ladli Banoo has specially
made this request to you.

431
00:41:47,985 --> 00:41:50,476
I will definitely
attend the symposium.

432
00:42:20,851 --> 00:42:22,694
Let the symposium begin.

433
00:42:23,020 --> 00:42:35,273
'When they remove the
veil from their face.'

434
00:42:47,878 --> 00:42:59,890
'They take away the color
of the garden of flowers.'

435
00:42:59,890 --> 00:43:10,960
'Wine cellars are
existent in their eyes.'

436
00:43:11,902 --> 00:43:23,996
'They make crazy,
whoever they see.'

437
00:43:31,969 --> 00:43:45,940
'They answer
loyalty with betrayal.'

438
00:43:59,790 --> 00:44:12,908
'How heartless they are, what
they take and what they give.'

439
00:44:13,804 --> 00:44:26,922
'They are sitting as if
they have seen us at all.'

440
00:44:39,830 --> 00:44:51,924
'This is the charm
that makes us crazy.'

441
00:45:04,895 --> 00:45:15,271
'They decorate youth with
different clothes of beauty.'

442
00:45:27,164 --> 00:45:38,052
'That's how the one who
respect beauty answer it.'

443
00:45:43,013 --> 00:45:53,389
'What is love?., ask the kings.'

444
00:45:54,024 --> 00:46:04,400
'They make beauty
sit on the throne.'

445
00:46:09,373 --> 00:46:21,051
'O the people who
count money with money.'

446
00:46:21,051 --> 00:46:30,073
'We answer love with love.'

447
00:46:30,521 --> 00:46:33,217
Who is this ill mannered
person?. Maids, go and see.

448
00:46:35,987 --> 00:46:38,000
But the verse of
the poem is very good.

449
00:46:38,056 --> 00:46:40,513
Young lady, come forward.

450
00:46:50,001 --> 00:46:54,916
The emperor has heard your
beautiful poem but has not...

451
00:46:55,006 --> 00:46:55,825
... seen your face.

452
00:46:56,007 --> 00:46:56,826
Who are you?.

453
00:47:00,512 --> 00:47:03,891
I am your subject,
Arjuman Banoo.

454
00:47:06,017 --> 00:47:09,225
Daughter of Asif Khan, and the
granddaughter of Mirza Qayat.

455
00:47:10,021 --> 00:47:11,170
How beautiful!

456
00:47:12,023 --> 00:47:14,890
She is a beautiful jewel.
I had thought that I had...

457
00:47:15,026 --> 00:47:18,063
... acquired the
most enchanting pearl.

458
00:47:18,363 --> 00:47:21,230
But even now, there are
such priceless jewels present.

459
00:47:21,266 --> 00:47:24,906
Arjuman, by reciting this poem
you have made me interested in...

460
00:47:25,036 --> 00:47:28,927
... poetry, go beyond extremes.
I want to hear the whole poem.

461
00:47:29,962 --> 00:47:30,951
As you say your highness.

462
00:48:06,999 --> 00:48:17,045
'We are punished
for the crime of love.'

463
00:48:26,185 --> 00:48:36,049
'They are so stupid,
they fan fire.'

464
00:48:40,366 --> 00:48:49,547
'People call us crazy
and are loyal to us.'

465
00:48:59,218 --> 00:49:09,082
'Whether we live or not,
we keep our promises.'

466
00:49:21,073 --> 00:49:29,572
'What is a throne
and what is wealth?. '

467
00:49:40,092 --> 00:49:49,626
'The lovers give
up God's name too.'

468
00:49:54,106 --> 00:50:02,434
'We have given the heart,
and taken the asset of loyalty.'

469
00:50:12,124 --> 00:50:28,314
'You can happily give me
any punishment you wish.'

470
00:50:29,642 --> 00:50:30,973
Beautiful, what words, it is
full of truth and philosophy...

471
00:50:31,143 --> 00:50:32,986
.... and indeed
a beautiful verse.

472
00:50:33,145 --> 00:50:34,988
By God, this is magic!
It is magic!

473
00:50:32,229 --> 00:50:34,072
Beautiful, what words!
What a great meaning they have!

474
00:50:34,231 --> 00:50:35,858
As if flowers are
gently dropping from her words.

475
00:50:36,233 --> 00:50:40,124
Supreme God, you give
support to those who have no one.

476
00:50:40,237 --> 00:50:44,128
You are the protector
those who are helpless.

477
00:50:44,241 --> 00:50:48,132
A sinner like me, my
respect is in your hands.

478
00:50:49,246 --> 00:50:52,113
Please give me courage, that
even if I have to face death l...

479
00:50:52,249 --> 00:50:54,604
