its eyes and smile.

480
00:50:55,499 --> 00:51:00,243
That I can face all the
adversity and difficulties.

481
00:51:00,504 --> 00:51:05,578
- Asif Khan is alive,
my daughter. - Father!

482
00:51:06,343 --> 00:51:09,551
A friend told me that
