484
00:51:11,348 --> 00:51:14,215
After coming here, it proved
to be right. Come along with me.

485
00:51:14,351 --> 00:51:20,290
Father, I am scared that...
have to face danger.

486
00:51:20,357 --> 00:51:22,200
