487
00:51:22,359 --> 00:51:27,274
The empress can take
away my status and respect.

488
00:51:27,404 --> 00:51:29,247
But she cannot take
away my child from me.

489
00:51:29,406 --> 00:51:37,393
So much resentment, and so
much anger, and that too...

490
00:51:37,414 --> 00:51:39,257
... without any reason.

491
00:51:39,416 --> 00:51:40,235
Without any reason!

492
00:51:40,584 --> 00:51:44,304
