00:51:56,473 --> 00:52:00,364
... path, starts to venture
on the dark road, then, to...

497
00:52:00,477 --> 00:52:03,344
... put her under
siege is not a sin.

498
00:52:03,480 --> 00:52:06,347
You are insulting me, if
anyone else would have put...

499
00:52:06,483 --> 00:52:09,350
... this serious allegation,
then I promise on God l.....

500
00:52:09,486 --> 00:52:12,353
Behave in a decent manner,
Asif Khan. Do not forget that...

501
00:52:12,449 --> 00:52:14,462
... you are a talking
to the Empress Noorjehan.

502
00:52:14,618 --> 00:52:17,314
You too, do not forget that
you have put a slap on the...

503
00:52:17,454 --> 00:52:20,321
... face of Amir-Ul-Umrahi,
Amin-U-Daulla, the prime...

504
