Consequence of what?.

507
00:52:49,486 --> 00:52:52,353
Young man, when the fragrance
of flowers begins to emerge...

508
00:52:52,489 --> 00:52:55,356
... from the gardens then
it is under stood that the...

509
00:52:55,492 --> 00:52:57,847
... flowers have opened up.

510
00:52:58,495 --> 00:53:02,386
In the same way, when a
father sees a special kind...

