618
01:00:21,817 --> 01:00:28,131
Excellent. You've had mercy on
me whenever I've been in trouble.

619
01:00:53,884 --> 01:00:56,751
The Emperor has full
acceptance of your decision,

620
01:00:57,221 --> 01:01:00,941
Go quickly and...

