meeting me, he can never go.

636
01:02:21,972 --> 01:02:22,791
Who are you?.

637
01:02:23,974 --> 01:02:25,817
I am the personal
servant of Prince Khurram.

638
01:02:27,478 --> 01:02:30,174
- Where is the prince?.
- He has left for Deccan.

639
01:02:30,981 --> 01:02:33,848
He has left a message that
he would have definitely met...

640
01:02:33,984 --> 01:02:36,851
you before going, but was
afraid, that love may become an...

641
