... obstruction in his duty.

642
01:02:39,990 --> 01:02:41,833
He asked you not to feel
any remorse, but pray that...

643
01:02:41,992 --> 01:02:44,005
... he is
successful in his mission.

644
01:03:33,525 --> 01:03:43,730
'O God, why is there war just
for land's sake on your Earth??'

645
01:03:44,603 --> 01:03:54,581
