have the mind for violence??'

646
01:04:00,552 --> 01:04:05,467
'The land is yours,
we are yours too.'

647
01:04:05,557 --> 01:04:10,472
'Where does the
question of ownership come??'

648
01:04:10,562 --> 01:04:15,477
'Why is there a
tradition of war??'

649
01:04:15,567 --> 01:04:20,823
'What is this penchant
for killing and blood shed??'

650
01:04:20,906 --> 01:04:26,492
'The people who
wish the world..'

651
01:04:26,578 --> 01:04:31,493
'..Why are their
hearts so stingy??'

652
01:04:41,760 --> 01:04:46,832
'Please give the
poor mothers and..'

653
01:04:46,832 --> 01:04:52,532
