thrones in the court of Jehangir.

677
01:07:53,865 --> 01:07:55,196
Come with me.

678
01:07:58,203 --> 01:08:01,240
The light of my eyes.
This throne is yours.

679
01:08:01,272 --> 01:08:03,376
