greetings of your subject.

692
01:09:24,067 --> 01:09:29,937
Tell me, Did you ever remember me
there?. - Why did you ask this?.

693
01:09:31,007 --> 01:09:32,850
I heard - What heard.

694
01:09:34,010 --> 01:09:37,047
I have heard that the women
of Deccan are very beautiful.

695
01:09:37,080 --> 01:09:40,561
You are right. Just in time,
I was saved from embarrassment.

696
01:09:40,583 --> 01:09:41,333
Why?.

697
01:09:41,417 --> 01:09:44,898
Don't ask me this Banno.
When I captured a city,...

698
01:09:45,021 --> 01:09:47,376
... many gifts were given to me.

699
01:09:48,024 --> 01:09:50,891
The one who presented
the gifts was a young lady.

700
01:09:54,531 --> 01:09:55,862
- A young lady! - Yes.

701
01:09:57,667 --> 01:10:00,909
She looked like, lightening
which had dropped from the sky.

702
01:10:01,037 --> 01:10:03,050
- I was totally
smitten by her. - Why?.

703
01:10:03,106 --> 01:10:05,904
Because she was so beautiful.

704
01:10:07,377 --> 01:10:10,244
- Then?. - She came
smiling towards me.

705
01:10:14,050 --> 01:10:17,258
Then she went away. I
had lost my heart to her.

706
01:10:17,387 --> 01:10:21,619
I followed her and called
out to her and she stopped.

707
01:10:21,624 --> 01:10:22,374
Then?.

708
01:10:22,458 --> 01:10:25,939
Then her helpless eyes
looked at me and the...

709
01:10:26,062 --> 01:10:28,235
... whole universe lighted up.

710
01:10:28,565 --> 01:10:31,944
I moved forward,
she too moved forward.

711
01:10:32,068 --> 01:10:35,959
Our hearts started to beat.
Overwhelming emotions of love...

712
01:10:36,072 --> 01:10:36,891
... were felt in my heart.

713
01:10:37,073 --> 01:10:40,452
I moved my hand forward,
she too gave me her hand.

714
01:10:40,577 --> 01:10:43,956
My lips were trembling, and
her lips too started to tremble.

715
01:10:44,040 --> 01:10:51,003
Then I said something to her,
that she got up and went away.

716
01:10:52,048 --> 01:10:54,573
I am very happy,
you deserve this.

717
01:10:54,617 --> 01:10:57,927
But I went after her again.
I asked her name.

718
01:10:58,054 --> 01:11:01,091
- Do you want to know her name?.
- I don't want to know.

719
01:11:01,224 --> 01:11:10,064
Listen to me, you are crying.
Her name was Arjuman Banoo.

720
01:11:10,233 --> 01:11:15,307
- Really! - She was
no one else, it was you.

721
01:11:16,072 --> 01:11:19,451
It was your memory.
It was your dream.

722
01:11:18,388 --> 01:11:21,255
Unneccassarily you troubled me.

723
01:12:17,113 --> 01:12:20,833
'The youth makes
the life beautiful.'

724
01:12:20,950 --> 01:12:25,182
'Love gives proof
that the heart exists.'

725
01:12:25,955 --> 01:12:29,334
'lf this is not here,
there is nothing in life.'

726
01:12:29,358 --> 01:12:36,252
'ln every heart,
there exists a veiled one.'

727
01:13:00,990 --> 01:13:06,929
'The oscitations of beauty
exists in every celebration.'

728
01:13:09,999 --> 01:13:16,962
'The shadow of love
exists everywhere.'

729
01:13:19,008 --> 01:13:22,899
'Transparent somewhere
and prevalent somewhere.'

730
01:14:15,064 --> 01:14:22,027
'The rhythm of love
is existent on this.'

731
01:14:25,074 --> 01:14:31,013
'The moonlight is
existent on this.'

732
01:14:33,082 --> 01:14:42,104
'lf you wish, take
heaven here itself.'

733
01:15:56,165 --> 01:15:58,178
Take care.

734
01:16:25,695 --> 01:16:29,074
O Lord! I will have to go.

735
01:16:56,212 --> 01:16:59,750
As soon as the prince came,
I caught hold of him and...

736
01:16:59,882 --> 01:17:03,773
... threw him on the floor
so badly that the body of...

737
01:17:03,886 --> 01:17:08,118
... the prince fell on the
floor and his soul went up there.

738
01:17:08,124 --> 01:17:11,764
Very good. I am very happy
the achievement you have made...

739
01:17:11,894 --> 01:17:15,785
... will be written in
history in golden letters.

740
01:17:15,898 --> 01:17:19,277
Now, I can see the royal
throne right in front of me.

741
01:17:20,903 --> 01:17:22,052
- Listen. - Yes sir.

742
01:17:22,138 --> 01:17:23,469
Where did you
bury the dead body?.

743
01:17:23,539 --> 01:17:26,952
This work we left for
Khawaja Mashroof to do.

744
01:17:26,936 --> 01:17:29,734
He will definitely do
something about the body.

745
01:17:29,872 --> 01:17:33,410
Sir, there has been a disaster.

746
01:17:33,442 --> 01:17:34,704
What has happened?.

747
01:17:34,877 --> 01:17:36,890
The body of prince
Khurram has disappeared.

748
01:17:37,947 --> 01:17:40,745
Where has it gone
and how did this happen?.

749
01:17:40,883 --> 01:17:42,214
God only knows this.

750
01:17:43,052 --> 01:17:45,748
You fools, if god knows
everything then what...

751
01:17:45,888 --> 01:17:47,037
... do you all know?.

752
01:17:47,123 --> 01:17:49,068
Why did you all
leave the body there?.

753
01:17:49,892 --> 01:17:53,783
Remember if the emperor finds
out about this conspiracy,...

754
01:17:53,936 --> 01:17:56,109
... he'll break my bones.

755
01:17:57,940 --> 01:18:04,903
Queen, practically all the
princes and princesses have...

756
01:18:04,947 --> 01:18:12,080
... come to see me, but
I haven't seen Khurram.

757
01:18:14,123 --> 01:18:16,819
Is he not aware of my illness?.

758
01:18:16,959 --> 01:18:19,826
How can this be,
emperor?. In front of the whole...

759
01:18:19,962 --> 01:18:24,365
... gathering, you fell sick
how is it that he didn't see you.

760
01:18:24,467 --> 01:18:27,163
Then why has he not come?.

761
01:18:27,970 --> 01:18:31,178
Maybe he is busy in
some other interest of his.

762
01:18:31,974 --> 01:18:34,841
He is young and has just
won laurels at the war and...

763
01:18:34,977 --> 01:18:37,844
... the arrogance of the
honours you have bestowed on...

764
01:18:37,980 --> 01:18:41,871
him is there too, so why should
he think of his sick father.

765
01:18:41,984 --> 01:18:45,192
No queen, my
Khurram is not like this.

766
01:18:45,788 --> 01:18:50,191
He should be informed immediately
that I'm restless to see him.

767
01:18:56,799 --> 01:18:57,618
He has gone to sleep.

768
01:19:03,973 --> 01:19:07,181
- How are you
feeling now?. - I am better.

769
01:19:08,811 --> 01:19:12,702
- Should I put some ointment?.
- My saviour what is the...

770
01:19:12,815 --> 01:19:14,988
... need of the ointment now.

771
01:19:15,818 --> 01:19:19,424
When you put your hand on
my wounds, I was alright.

772
01:19:19,455 --> 01:19:25,769
God is great, he saved you.
Or else the enemies were...

773
01:19:25,748 --> 01:19:28,103
... out to see you killed.

774
01:19:29,752 --> 01:19:32,619
I will go to the emperor just
now and tell him everything,...

775
01:19:32,755 --> 01:19:33,574
... about this incident.

776
01:19:33,756 --> 01:19:35,599
Don't go Arjuman, do not go.

777
01:19:35,758 --> 01:19:38,625
This is the conspiracy of
the empress. Her magic is...

778
01:19:38,761 --> 01:19:41,628
...going on, otherwise Shariyar
would have never got this...

779
01:19:41,764 --> 01:19:44,801
... conspiracy in his head to
send me a letter on your behalf.

780
01:19:45,768 --> 01:19:51,707
Let this be Arjuman. I will
give them such a befitting reply...

781
01:19:48,974 --> 01:19:50,817
... that they'll
remember it forever.

782
01:19:56,615 --> 01:20:00,187
This continuous absence
of a suspicion in my mind.

783
01:20:00,986 --> 01:20:05,901
You are only suspicious, but
I am sure that he is involved...

784
01:20:05,991 --> 01:20:08,346
... in some planning.

785
01:20:09,995 --> 01:20:13,886
Shariyar send him a message that
by tomorrow evening Khurram...

786
01:20:13,999 --> 01:20:16,866
... should give me the answer
for this behaviour of his.

787
01:20:14,442 --> 01:20:15,591
Or else I will.....

788
01:20:27,714 --> 01:20:30,922
- Banoo, some calamity has
happened. - What has happened?.

789
01:20:31,051 --> 01:20:32,382
Prince Khurram has
been termed as a rebel.

790
01:20:32,552 --> 01:20:36,443
The Emperor has ordered
that if the prince does not...

791
01:20:36,516 --> 01:20:39,724
... go to see him, he
will be declared a traitor.

792
01:20:39,853 --> 01:20:44,415
Me, and traitor. This is
the second trip of enemy.

793
01:20:45,025 --> 01:20:47,380
- I have to go to him.
- How will you go?.

794
01:20:47,861 --> 01:20:51,399
Those who have advised emperor
to order this they must have...

795
01:20:51,571 --> 01:20:55,109
... made arrangements that
you should never reach him.

796
01:20:55,141 --> 01:20:56,403
Whatever it is Arjuman.

797
01:20:56,576 --> 01:21:00,467
The emperor will have to be told
who is the real traitor, even...

798
01:21:00,580 --> 01:21:03,959
... if I have to put my
life at stake for this.

799
01:21:03,983 --> 01:21:09,000
Prince, your life does
not belong to you alone.

800
01:21:09,589 --> 01:21:11,432
I too have a right on it.

801
01:21:12,592 --> 01:21:15,800
The empress has a lot
of pride in her kingdom.

802
01:21:16,636 --> 01:21:21,551
She has forgotten that l
too belong to the same family.

803
01:21:21,808 --> 01:21:23,981
In my blood too,
flows the same blood.

804
01:21:24,644 --> 01:21:27,169
I too can give an
answer to all her conspiracies.

805
01:21:28,982 --> 01:21:30,483
You do not worry.

806
01:21:31,818 --> 01:21:34,514
I will find a way
out to meet the emperor.

807
01:21:35,655 --> 01:21:36,804
You will definitely meet him.

808
01:21:38,658 --> 01:21:41,525
Emperor has made
tomorrow Khurram does...

809
01:21:41,661 --> 01:21:45,552
... meet him by tomorrow evening
he will be declared a rebel...

810
01:21:45,665 --> 01:21:46,814
... and a traitor.

811
01:21:48,835 --> 01:21:50,496
If he is alive, then
he will definitely try...

812
01:21:50,670 --> 01:21:52,001
... to meet the emperor.

813
01:21:53,840 --> 01:21:57,560
If Khurram reaches
there then we are dead.

814
01:21:57,677 --> 01:22:00,885
This is very bad news prince
Shariyar, now what should we do.

815
01:22:00,914 --> 01:22:03,530
Just think, think that if
Khurram is alive then why...

816
01:22:03,683 --> 01:22:06,550
... is he alive and if he
is alive then where is he?.

817
01:22:08,688 --> 01:22:10,531
Ask this from me?.

818
01:22:10,690 --> 01:22:15,946
Gulbadan, what do you know?.

819
01:22:16,696 --> 01:22:21,611
Arjuman begum has
given him love and shelter.

820
01:22:21,701 --> 01:22:25,592
Right now, he is in the palace
of the prime minister Asif Khan.

821
01:22:25,665 --> 01:22:29,556
Thank Gulbadan for giving
me this piece of news I will...

822
01:22:29,669 --> 01:22:31,512
... give you
the greatest reward.

823
01:22:31,671 --> 01:22:33,172
This is my promise. Now go.

824
01:22:37,677 --> 01:22:39,520
Kwaja Masroor - Yes Sir.

825
01:22:39,679 --> 01:22:42,546
The basement in which Khurram
is hiding, make that basement...

826
01:22:42,682 --> 01:22:43,831
... into his tomb.

827
01:22:43,917 --> 01:22:45,509
Outside the palaces of
Asif Khan and Jehangir,...

828
01:22:45,685 --> 01:22:48,336
put security guards
at every step and corner.

829
01:22:48,688 --> 01:22:50,531
See that Khurram does not
leave this place to go...

830
01:22:50,690 --> 01:22:51,509
... to that palace.

831
01:22:53,693 --> 01:22:54,512
Stop there.

832
01:22:56,863 --> 01:22:58,524
You girls. Come on.

833
01:23:02,869 --> 01:23:05,565
Where are you going with
wearing your anklets, making...

834
01:23:05,705 --> 01:23:06,524
... all this sound.

835
01:23:06,706 --> 01:23:10,756
You don't heard, Rana Daljit Singh
has become the father of a son.

836
01:23:10,777 --> 01:23:13,575
They have sent sweets
for the empress Noorjehan.

837
01:23:13,713 --> 01:23:15,886
What about giving us some too?.

838
01:23:18,718 --> 01:23:20,561
Just look at this fool's face.

839
01:23:21,721 --> 01:23:25,771
Give him to eat some,
or else he'll curse.

840
01:23:25,792 --> 01:23:29,614
O God, but what wrong
have the other guards done?.

841
01:23:29,729 --> 01:23:31,742
So lets give to all of them.

842
01:24:01,394 --> 01:24:02,918
I have got the
announcement made.

843
01:24:04,397 --> 01:24:09,346
It's already evening, but
Khurram hasn't still come.

844
01:24:11,811 --> 01:24:12,960
Your servant is present.

845
01:24:13,813 --> 01:24:17,863
Who is he?. Finish him off.

846
01:24:27,827 --> 01:24:31,035
What is this condition
of yours?. Where were you?.

847
01:24:35,835 --> 01:24:37,848
Forgive me but...

848
01:24:41,908 --> 01:24:42,658
Please leave all of you.

849
01:24:49,689 --> 01:24:52,897
Where were you till now?.
Why did you not come to see me?.

850
01:24:53,927 --> 01:24:55,519
See this deap wound, emperor.

851
01:24:55,695 --> 01:24:58,562
In your presence, in the
premises of the palace, an...

852
01:24:58,698 --> 01:25:00,541
... attempt was made to kill me.

853
01:25:00,700 --> 01:25:05,615
Who were those traitors who have
not attacked prince Khurram...

854
01:25:05,705 --> 01:25:08,572
... but have
attacked Emperor Jehangir.

855
01:25:08,708 --> 01:25:10,039
Tell me their names.

856
01:25:16,716 --> 01:25:20,607
Father please be careful. Tell
me the names of those traitors.

857
01:25:20,720 --> 01:25:22,563
Father, I can
sacrifice many lives for you.

858
01:25:22,722 --> 01:25:25,589
Please do not get
agitated it'll effect your health.

859
01:25:25,725 --> 01:25:32,688
- Khurram, I want their names.
- Names! I don't know, it was...

860
01:25:32,732 --> 01:25:36,623
dark, I couldn't see anything.

861
01:25:36,736 --> 01:25:41,810
You couldn't recognize them,...
because of my condition.

862
01:25:44,811 --> 01:25:45,561
Come on tell me.

863
01:25:55,088 --> 01:26:00,674
My Khurram is a
brave this I am aware of.

864
01:26:01,761 --> 01:26:06,676
But today I have come to know
that he is a merciful human...

865
01:26:06,766 --> 01:26:10,657
... being too, who out of
pity for his old father...

866
01:26:10,770 --> 01:26:14,661
... is ready to hide the
names of his enemies too.

867
01:26:17,110 --> 01:26:18,953
I am very pleased with you.

868
01:26:21,781 --> 01:26:25,672
Father, in this happy atmosphere
I want to pay back the favour...

869
01:26:25,785 --> 01:26:29,676
to that lady who put her youth,
her respect, her dignity...

870
01:26:29,789 --> 01:26:32,144
... at stake and saved my life.

871
01:26:33,793 --> 01:26:34,782
Who is she?.

872
01:26:34,861 --> 01:26:37,989
The daughter of the prime
minister, she is Arjuman Banoo.

873
01:26:40,800 --> 01:26:44,691
Not only you Khurram but the
whole Mughal empire is grateful...

874
01:26:44,804 --> 01:26:48,695
to Arjuman Banoo, that she
has saved the most outstanding...

875
01:26:48,808 --> 01:26:50,981
... Iight of this
dynasty from fading away.

876
01:26:52,447 --> 01:26:56,167
Now very soon, I will get
you married to Arjuman Banoo.

877
01:26:56,184 --> 01:26:58,800
I will with my own hands put
your wedding head gear on you.

878
01:27:00,455 --> 01:27:03,834
The emperor has taken the
decision that Arjuman Banoo will..

879
01:27:03,958 --> 01:27:07,849
marry prince Khurram and I too
have taken a decision that you...

880
01:27:07,962 --> 01:27:10,135
... will marry Ladli Banoo.

881
01:27:11,966 --> 01:27:16,881
I promise you that after I am
gone the empress of lndia will...

882
01:27:16,971 --> 01:27:18,814
... not be Arjuman Banoo.

883
01:28:58,310 --> 01:29:02,201
'The body of silver
and the eyes of gold.'

884
01:29:02,314 --> 01:29:08,253
'To that add charms,
what can one say??'

885
01:29:20,332 --> 01:29:29,354
'Who all has your beauty
destroyed, what can be said??'

886
01:29:39,351 --> 01:29:42,218
'A sinful tongue,
and a sinful glance.'

887
01:29:42,354 --> 01:29:47,269
'What can be said of
this color of your mind??'

888
01:30:01,373 --> 01:30:10,395
'ls there such a love in
this world, what can one say??'

889
01:30:15,514 --> 01:30:23,330
'Under the veil,
this face which as pink as a rose'

890
01:30:30,362 --> 01:30:34,253
There is the color of the roses
as well as the shine of the stars.

891
01:30:50,015 --> 01:30:57,353
'At this time, we don't care even
for heaven. What can one say??'

892
01:31:09,735 --> 01:31:13,273
'Since the time I met you,
we have left the three worlds.'

893
01:31:13,405 --> 01:31:16,613
'Leaving one need, all
our needs have disappeared.'

894
01:31:16,642 --> 01:31:18,234
'We drank from
your beautiful eyes.'

895
01:31:18,410 --> 01:31:20,253
'We even left
the glass of wine.'

896
01:31:20,412 --> 01:31:24,303
'When the silky hair fluttered,
even we fluttered a bit.'

897
01:31:24,416 --> 01:31:31,379
'We even forgot who
gets the world any longer.'

898
01:31:46,438 --> 01:31:49,976
'Don't look at us
with such warm eyes..

899
01:31:50,009 --> 01:31:53,831
'..these bodies can melt too.'

900
01:32:00,452 --> 01:32:06,391
'Look in such a way, the dew
of beauty doesn't get evaporated.'

901
01:32:15,467 --> 01:32:18,334
You forget the
beauty you have seen.

902
01:32:25,644 --> 01:32:30,718
'What can be said of the
bestiality of you people??'

903
01:32:41,660 --> 01:32:45,380
That you can win over us, do not
remain under that impression.

904
01:32:45,497 --> 01:32:48,705
That we will disgrace ourselves,
we aren't so naive.

905
01:32:48,834 --> 01:32:52,372
What if someone dies. Doesn't
mean an obligation on us.

906
01:32:52,504 --> 01:32:55,712
Why should we talk to
someone whom we do not know.

907
01:32:55,841 --> 01:32:59,732
Even if you desire,
we do not desire.

908
01:32:59,745 --> 01:33:02,714
We do not desire,
we do not desire!

909
01:33:19,531 --> 01:33:33,673
The people whom you refuse for,
what luck they have.

910
01:33:46,558 --> 01:33:55,580
And those for whom you wish, their
fortune cannot be explained!

911
01:33:59,204 --> 01:34:06,542
They give yearnings day and night.
This is the state of the lovelorns.

912
01:34:06,578 --> 01:34:09,445
This is the state of the lovers.

913
01:34:35,527 --> 01:34:41,466
Wherever they see a new face,
their heart goes a flutter.

914
01:34:41,533 --> 01:34:45,424
They will take that. This is
the state of the lovers.

915
01:34:48,540 --> 01:34:52,772
For whom we tolerate tortures
and hope, our fate is such

916
01:34:52,778 --> 01:34:56,600
We are called crazy
by those same people.

917
01:35:10,562 --> 01:35:15,477
This life becomes problematic
because of these lovers.

918
01:35:15,567 --> 01:35:19,799
Should we look after them, or
should we take care of ourselves?.

919
01:35:19,805 --> 01:35:24,481
Every word is a request,
every look is a question.

920
01:35:28,747 --> 01:35:32,979
He's felling restless and sorrow.

921
01:35:38,757 --> 01:35:40,770
My sleep has gone,
my peace has gone.

922
01:35:40,826 --> 01:35:44,466
My previous 'taano
tavan ' has gone.

923
01:35:44,596 --> 01:35:48,487
If this is the state of things,
I will soon lose my life.

924
01:35:59,611 --> 01:36:03,502
If a person has a penchant to
commit suicide, what can one do?.

925
01:36:03,615 --> 01:36:08,530
Someone cures person with
the potion of heart.

926
01:36:08,620 --> 01:36:12,852
If someone flirts meaninglessly
why should one care?.

927
01:36:12,858 --> 01:36:17,534
Why should one confess
the helplessness of love?.

928
01:36:17,629 --> 01:36:23,568
It is enjoyable when you have
mercy and some one looks at you.

929
01:36:23,635 --> 01:36:33,681
If I die, and people
accuse you of murder.

930
01:36:50,829 --> 01:36:54,549
They don't die and
they don't live too.

931
01:36:54,666 --> 01:36:59,581
What can be said
of these lovers?.

932
01:37:17,679 --> 01:37:19,522
Both the
princes are married now.

933
01:37:21,516 --> 01:37:26,943
I want to appoint both of
them heads of separate regions.

934
01:37:27,562 --> 01:37:30,258
So that they can help
me in ruling the kingdom.

935
01:37:30,732 --> 01:37:36,318
Emperor, my opinion is to
let Shariyar be in Agra...

936
01:37:37,572 --> 01:37:43,340
... and let Khurram be sent
to Deccan as the incharge there.

937
01:37:44,412 --> 01:37:48,303
This way the burden on you
will lessen, and the rebels...

938
01:37:48,416 --> 01:37:52,978
... will never have the courage
to raise their heads against us.

939
01:37:54,422 --> 01:37:58,313
What an idea! Empress,
you always kill two birds...

940
01:37:58,426 --> 01:37:59,575
... with one stone.

941
01:38:01,429 --> 01:38:03,602
I will, tomorrow itself,
give the order for his departure.

942
01:38:02,541 --> 01:38:07,968
Its been ages since I have
been married, but my destiny...

943
01:38:08,046 --> 01:38:09,035
... has not changed.

944
01:38:10,115 --> 01:38:12,219
Lord, do not
disappoint me this time.

945
01:38:13,051 --> 01:38:16,259
Let my wishes be fulfilled. Let
one flower bloom in my garden.

946
01:38:16,434 --> 01:38:17,514
Give me one male child.

947
01:38:21,205 --> 01:38:22,024
May your wish come true.

948
01:38:23,207 --> 01:38:24,538
What's the news?. Is it a boy?.

949
01:38:24,609 --> 01:38:27,225
No, it's a girl.
Give me my reward.

950
01:38:27,278 --> 01:38:28,540
Oh no, again my
destiny has cheated me.

951
01:38:28,633 --> 01:38:30,988
Why did you come here with
your stupid face, why didn't...

952
01:38:31,055 --> 01:38:33,068
... you go to Burhanpur,
to Shahjehan.

953
01:38:33,124 --> 01:38:36,252
Sir, do not get angry with her.
This is a gift of God.

954
01:38:36,294 --> 01:38:40,116
Who wants such gifts?.
This is the third princess.

955
01:38:40,231 --> 01:38:43,951
On the other hand Shahjehan
has no shortage of boys.

956
01:38:44,068 --> 01:38:46,935
But here always girls born.

957
01:38:47,238 --> 01:38:49,934
Sir, the angels have made
a mistake, they must have...

958
01:38:50,074 --> 01:38:51,917
... exchanged the
children by mistake.

959
01:38:52,076 --> 01:38:58,015
Otherwise, you would have
got a boy and he, a girl.

960
01:38:58,082 --> 01:38:59,925
No, its not that Mirza.

961
01:39:00,084 --> 01:39:01,927
It is in my destiny to be
defeated by Shahjehan in every...

962
01:39:02,086 --> 01:39:03,587
... avenue of life.

963
01:39:04,088 --> 01:39:07,979
What all didn't I try to do
against him, and what all...

964
01:39:08,092 --> 01:39:13,007
didn't I do to take his life,
but nothing happened to him.

965
01:39:13,097 --> 01:39:16,988
Empress, sent him thousands
of miles away from Agra to...

966
01:39:17,101 --> 01:39:20,309
... Burhanapur, but my
destiny still evaded me.

967
01:39:20,438 --> 01:39:26,377
Destiny has been very kind to
me. God has given me everything.

968
01:39:27,111 --> 01:39:31,343
The biggest gifts are these
two smiling flowers in my life.

969
01:39:32,145 --> 01:39:38,084
- There is one desire
still left. - A desire?.

970
01:39:39,486 --> 01:39:42,353
My eyes are desperately
wanting to see Agra again.

971
01:39:43,156 --> 01:39:49,095
That shore of the Yamuna.
That courtyard, where we gave...

972
01:39:49,162 --> 01:39:53,394
... each other
our promises of love.

973
01:39:54,167 --> 01:39:57,546
Do not worry begum, God is kind.

974
01:39:58,171 --> 01:40:01,038
I am just waiting for some
news from the emperor's court.

975
01:40:01,174 --> 01:40:05,065
If I am successful in this
campaign then I will ask...

976
01:40:05,178 --> 01:40:08,716
... my father to let
me stay in Agra forever.

977
01:40:13,353 --> 01:40:17,073
I want that during my life
time, the decision for my...

978
01:40:17,190 --> 01:40:21,081
... succession takes place
so that after I am no more,...

979
01:40:21,194 --> 01:40:24,061
... my sons do not fight
over the throne and crown.

980
01:40:26,199 --> 01:40:29,236
I want to take this
decision with all of you.

981
01:40:29,269 --> 01:40:33,091
If you want my humble opinion
then sir, I would suggest that...

982
01:40:33,206 --> 01:40:36,073
... prince Khurram instead of
being sent to Kandhar, should...

983
01:40:36,209 --> 01:40:37,028
... be called to
Agra immediately.

984
01:40:37,210 --> 01:40:41,101
Seeing his capabilities in life,
its better that at this delicate...

985
01:40:41,214 --> 01:40:44,081
... time he should
remain close to the Emperor.

986
01:40:44,217 --> 01:40:48,108
Instead of him, prince Shariyar
should be sent to Kandhar.

987
01:40:48,221 --> 01:40:51,429
You have said, what
my heart wanted too.

988
01:40:51,458 --> 01:40:55,451
This is a very good suggestion,
Emperor.

989
01:40:55,562 --> 01:41:01,148
Prime minister, immediately send
a messenger to Kandhar and ask...

990
01:41:01,234 --> 01:41:05,466
... Khurram to
come back to Agra.

991
01:41:06,239 --> 01:41:08,252
Your order will be carried out.

992
01:41:15,582 --> 01:41:20,497
- I too wanted to say
something. - Empress, its you.

993
01:41:23,256 --> 01:41:26,123
It is not my purpose to
disagree with the decision...

994
01:41:26,259 --> 01:41:29,126
... of Emperor, nor do l
want to become an obstacle...

995
01:41:29,262 --> 01:41:30,411
... in anyone's plans.

996
01:41:31,431 --> 01:41:36,175
But to think
about It is my right,...

997
01:41:36,269 --> 01:41:38,442
... and duty too.

998
01:41:38,505 --> 01:41:43,181
You are right, Empress.
You can say what you want to.

999
01:41:43,276 --> 01:41:47,508
Asif Khan is my brother.
I am not his enemy.

1000
01:41:48,281 --> 01:41:51,660
Today in his suggestion,
there was a selfish motive.

1001
01:41:52,285 --> 01:41:55,152
Empress! What is
this you are saying?.

1002
01:41:55,288 --> 01:42:00,203
Emperor, you know this very well
that Shariyar is not at all...

1003
01:42:00,293 --> 01:42:04,184
... familiar with the region of
Kandhar, and if he is sent to...

1004
01:42:04,297 --> 01:42:08,188
far away Kandhar, do you know
what its consequences will be?.

1005
01:42:08,301 --> 01:42:13,216
I will tell you today. Our
forces will be defeated.

1006
01:42:13,306 --> 01:42:16,173
The region of Kandhar
will be taken away from us.

1007
01:42:16,309 --> 01:42:21,383
While Shariyar will be killed.
This is what Asif Khan wants.

1008
01:42:23,316 --> 01:42:32,668
Supreme god, what should I do?.
My mental tension is increasing.

1009
01:42:34,327 --> 01:42:37,364
Continuing illness has taken
away my power of decision making.

1010
01:42:39,332 --> 01:42:44,247
Loyal people like Asif Khan
will turn so selfish with time,...

1011
01:42:44,337 --> 01:42:46,180
... this I had no knowledge.

1012
01:42:49,342 --> 01:42:54,257
Empress, You are not only the
empress of lndia but an empress...

1013
01:42:54,347 --> 01:42:57,384
... of wisdom and sagacity too.

1014
01:42:58,685 --> 01:43:02,223
I hand over the running
of the kingdom to you and...

1015
01:43:02,355 --> 01:43:06,246
... make an announcement
that from today all the royal...

1016
01:43:06,359 --> 01:43:09,226
... decisions have your
stamp of authority too.

1017
01:43:20,540 --> 01:43:26,308
Go immediately to Burhanpur
and give prince Khurram my...

1018
01:43:26,379 --> 01:43:30,270
...message, before destiny plays
another trick. He reached Agra.

1019
01:43:30,680 --> 01:43:35,242
The first order that I give
after taking over the reins is,...

1020
01:43:35,351 --> 01:43:40,266
... that Asif Khan be removed
from his post, and have no powers.

1021
01:43:40,356 --> 01:43:42,369
He should be put under guard.

1022
01:43:42,425 --> 01:43:45,223
He should not be allowed to
go out of the city of Agra.

1023
01:43:50,777 --> 01:43:52,278
- A disaster has taken place.
- What has happened?.

1024
01:43:52,445 --> 01:43:55,312
Empress has
stopped all your plans.

1025
01:43:55,448 --> 01:43:58,315
Emperor has handed over the
rule of the kingdom to her.

1026
01:43:58,451 --> 01:44:01,318
The first order she has passed...
Ionger the prime minister..

1027
01:44:01,454 --> 01:44:04,321
... and you should not be
allowed to go out of Agra.

1028
01:44:04,457 --> 01:44:07,324
How did this suddenly happen?.
Jai Singh, just now...

1029
01:44:07,460 --> 01:44:09,633
This is the plan of Empress.

1030
01:44:10,463 --> 01:44:11,964
God knows what
is going to happen.

1031
01:44:12,032 --> 01:44:14,318
I think your life
can be in danger.

1032
01:44:14,467 --> 01:44:18,699
I am not worried about my life.
What will happen to Khurram?.

1033
01:44:18,705 --> 01:44:21,321
What will become of
Arjuman and her children?.

1034
01:44:21,474 --> 01:44:24,341
It's good you came in time,...
would have gone.

1035
01:44:29,482 --> 01:44:34,397
Keep the forces of Kandhar
ready, may be we will have to...

1036
01:44:34,406 --> 01:44:37,785
... fight the
royal forces of Agra.

1037
01:44:37,810 --> 01:44:38,731
As you say.

1038
01:44:40,412 --> 01:44:45,327
Revenge can make the character
of a woman so terrifying.

1039
01:44:45,417 --> 01:44:47,260
This, I realized today.

1040
01:44:47,959 --> 01:44:51,338
Read it carefully, this is what
could be our situation in future.

1041
01:44:51,462 --> 01:44:56,718
No, I had earlier said
that Khurram is a rebel.

1042
01:44:57,468 --> 01:44:59,311
Later, I had to repent.

1043
01:44:59,470 --> 01:45:02,337
May be this news has
been spread by his enemies.

1044
01:45:02,473 --> 01:45:06,364
Emperor may be, what one
hears could be wrong, but...

1045
01:45:06,477 --> 01:45:08,320
... what one
sees cannot be wrong.

1046
01:45:08,479 --> 01:45:13,394
Ask my loyal friends they have
seen everything with their eyes.

1047
01:45:13,484 --> 01:45:16,863
This is correct Dil-E-Elahi.

1048
01:45:16,988 --> 01:45:21,550
Prince Khurram,
Shahjehan is for an attack.

1049
01:45:21,826 --> 01:45:24,522
- But why is he doing this?.
- To attack Agra.

1050
01:45:24,562 --> 01:45:30,068
He wants to take over Agra and
arrest the Empress and Emperor.

1051
01:45:30,068 --> 01:45:35,426
Quiet, I do not have the
strength to hear that this...

1052
01:45:35,506 --> 01:45:41,445
selfish person, that
thankless of arresting me.

1053
01:45:42,513 --> 01:45:44,356
How does he have the courage
to take over the throne as...

1054
01:45:44,515 --> 01:45:45,334
... I am still alive.

1055
01:45:47,518 --> 01:45:50,385
At once for his arrest,
an artillery unit should go.

1056
01:45:50,521 --> 01:45:52,364
You are right Emperor.

1057
01:45:52,523 --> 01:45:56,414
But who has the courage
to face Mewar and Deccan?.

1058
01:45:56,861 --> 01:46:02,447
Raja Jaisingh, the Mughal empire
is not bereft of brave warriors.

1059
01:46:02,533 --> 01:46:05,570
I will appoint Mahabat
Khan to head this campaign.

1060
01:46:07,605 --> 01:46:10,574
Empress, you and
Mahabat Khan......

1061
01:46:10,875 --> 01:46:15,619
He is my enemy, but not the
enemy of the Mughal empire.

1062
01:46:16,614 --> 01:46:20,436
I will forget my personal enmity
and protect the Mughal empire.

1063
01:46:21,797 --> 01:46:24,493
Give the order to
the forces to be ready.

1064
01:46:24,633 --> 01:46:27,500
Outside Burhanpur, I will face
the challenge of Mahavat Khan.

1065
01:46:29,271 --> 01:46:34,561
My dear, do not fight against
the royal forces of the empire.

1066
01:46:34,643 --> 01:46:38,534
If there is a fight
between the the world will laugh.

1067
01:46:38,647 --> 01:46:41,855
The justice of Jehangir
will be under question.

1068
01:46:42,651 --> 01:46:46,542
The brave stories and
valour of prince Khurram will...

1069
01:46:46,655 --> 01:46:47,474
... be termed as lies.

1070
01:46:47,656 --> 01:46:49,829
Sister Arjuman is right.

1071
01:46:50,659 --> 01:46:54,550
Rana Karan Singhji its you.
How come the King of Mewar...

1072
01:46:54,663 --> 01:46:55,482
... is in Burhanpur.

1073
01:46:55,998 --> 01:47:00,560
As soon as I came to know that
there is going to be a battle...

1074
01:47:00,669 --> 01:47:04,560
... between Jehangir and
Khurram I couldn't stop my self.

1075
01:47:04,673 --> 01:47:09,588
Prince, for the sake of our
friendship and love which...

1076
01:47:09,678 --> 01:47:13,569
... you had, with my dead father
Amar Singh and now with me,...

1077
01:47:13,682 --> 01:47:14,501
... please stop this war.

1078
01:47:14,683 --> 01:47:17,550
If the swords of the father
and son clash with each other...

1079
01:47:17,686 --> 01:47:19,699
the heads of children in all
times, will hang down in shame.

1080
01:47:19,755 --> 01:47:22,883
Believe me Rana, I have
not tried to start this war.

1081
01:47:23,025 --> 01:47:27,257
My enemies want my throne
my crown, and my life too.

1082
01:47:27,696 --> 01:47:30,563
- For which I am going to
fight. - To save your life.

1083
01:47:30,699 --> 01:47:35,614
Yes, because my life and
each of mine belongs to somebody.

1084
01:47:35,704 --> 01:47:39,595
You come with me Udaipur. For
your life and respect..

1085
01:47:39,708 --> 01:47:42,575
... I can sacrifice my life.

1086
01:47:42,711 --> 01:47:44,554
This is the oath of a Rajput.

1087
01:47:44,713 --> 01:47:48,604
But Karan Singh, Mahabat Khan has
left Agra with the Mughal forces.

1088
01:47:48,717 --> 01:47:50,275
He will follow
us into Mewar too.

1089
01:47:50,352 --> 01:47:53,594
Mahabat Khan will not have
the courage to step inside the...

1090
01:47:53,722 --> 01:47:57,613
... border of Mewar and if
his arrogance makes him reach...

1091
01:47:57,726 --> 01:48:00,593
... the doors of Mewar, then
this war will not be between...

1092
01:48:00,729 --> 01:48:03,596
... the father and son
but between Mahabat Khan...

1093
01:48:03,732 --> 01:48:04,551
... and Karan Singh.

1094
01:48:04,733 --> 01:48:08,624
The war will not be fought for
the throne and crown of lndia,...

1095
01:48:08,737 --> 01:48:11,604
but for the safety of the
life and respect of a brother.

1096
01:48:11,740 --> 01:48:17,146
Come on prince. The whole of
Mewar is waiting to welcome you.

1097
01:48:17,146 --> 01:48:21,139
My dear husband,
please agree to this advice.

1098
01:48:21,150 --> 01:48:23,607
May be this is good for us.

1099
01:49:05,631 --> 01:49:07,986
'No, please don't touch me.'

1100
01:49:08,034 --> 01:49:15,952
'l tell you again and again,
don't touch me.'

1101
01:49:17,276 --> 01:49:21,542
'Your beauty is golden,
and your tricks.'

1102
01:49:21,647 --> 01:49:27,927
'Your eyes are a
treasure of color, I like them.'

1103
01:49:44,904 --> 01:49:50,604
'My brother is strong,
my beloved is strong.'

1104
01:49:51,637 --> 01:49:58,258
'Swords will rise
if you look at me.'

1105
01:49:58,644 --> 01:50:05,948
'Your whole family will mourn
you. You will risk your life.'

1106
01:50:45,778 --> 01:50:51,546
The sword of your eyes
have pierced my heart.

1107
01:50:52,618 --> 01:50:59,239
Couldn't gaze at you,
such beauty you had.

1108
01:50:59,625 --> 01:51:06,588
It is beyond expressions!

1109
01:51:46,552 --> 01:51:52,650
My beloved guards the
treasure of my beauty.

1110
01:51:53,479 --> 01:51:59,577
May my beloved live just like
the depth of my love.

1111
01:51:59,659 --> 01:52:03,379
You are a stranger!

1112
01:52:31,524 --> 01:52:33,185
Mahabat Khan has come.

1113
01:52:46,539 --> 01:52:51,283
Rana Karan Singh you have given
shelter to the rebel of the...

1114
01:52:51,377 --> 01:52:52,196
... Mughal empire..

1115
01:52:52,378 --> 01:52:58,317
On behalf of Shehanshah Jehangir
I request you to hand over...

1116
01:52:58,420 --> 01:53:00,433
... Sultan Khurram to me.

1117
01:53:01,056 --> 01:53:06,346
Sultan Khurram is my brother,
and begum Arjuman is my sister.

1118
01:53:06,428 --> 01:53:09,295
I will not under any cost
hand over the husband of...

1119
01:53:09,431 --> 01:53:10,580
... my sister to you.

1120
01:53:12,768 --> 01:53:16,306
I am reading the royal
order in the name of Khurram.

1121
01:53:16,605 --> 01:53:21,349
If my rebel son Khurram
sends both his sons,...

1122
01:53:21,443 --> 01:53:26,358
in the service of the emperor,
his misdeeds will be forgiven,...

1123
01:53:26,615 --> 01:53:30,665
as I am responsible for
their safety and well being.

1124
01:53:31,453 --> 01:53:35,344
This order is not Emperor
Jehangir's but that of Empress.

1125
01:53:35,457 --> 01:53:38,324
To take away
innocent children...

1126
01:53:38,460 --> 01:53:43,022
from the parents does not
depict Noorjehan wants to take.

1127
01:53:43,058 --> 01:53:48,007
Mahabat Khan is the subject
and has to follow his order.

1128
01:53:48,430 --> 01:53:53,345
Rana Karan Singh, will the royal
command be adhered to or not.

1129
01:53:53,435 --> 01:53:58,350
No. - The emperor who has
become his son's enemy,...

1130
01:53:58,440 --> 01:54:01,307
why will he be kind
to his sons children.

1131
01:54:01,443 --> 01:54:06,358
He is cutting the roots, so how
can he claim that the branches...

1132
01:54:06,448 --> 01:54:07,267
... of the trees will flourish.

1133
01:54:07,449 --> 01:54:10,316
You will not get the
children Mahabat Khan.

1134
01:54:10,452 --> 01:54:13,319
If you don't listen, the royal
command will be carried out...

1135
01:54:13,455 --> 01:54:14,274
... by the use of this sword.

1136
01:54:14,456 --> 01:54:20,554
Do not threaten the dynasty of
Rana Sanga and Maharana Pratap.

1137
01:54:21,463 --> 01:54:25,354
The heads of the Rajput kings
did not bow down, even in front...

1138
01:54:25,467 --> 01:54:27,992
... of the valiant emperor
Akbar, and King Sher Shah.

1139
01:54:28,470 --> 01:54:30,825
So today, my head
will not bow down.

1140
01:54:31,473 --> 01:54:35,364
I take an oath that I will
get the heads of my children...

1141
01:54:35,477 --> 01:54:38,344
cut, and also the heads of
all the children in my kingdom...

1142
01:54:38,480 --> 01:54:42,371
but I will see, that the sons
of my sister come to no harm.

1143
01:54:42,484 --> 01:54:45,351
You do not understand,
there will be such a fight...

1144
01:54:45,487 --> 01:54:48,138
that rivers of
blood will flow here.

1145
01:54:49,658 --> 01:54:50,647
Stop there Mahabat Khan.

1146
01:55:00,669 --> 01:55:03,536
What Rana Karan has
said is bound to happen.

1147
01:55:03,839 --> 01:55:06,876
A Rajput's vow is invincible.

1148
01:55:07,676 --> 01:55:12,932
You too have
said blood will flow.

1149
01:55:14,516 --> 01:55:18,407
The blood of these valiant
