you as not my own, and...

1374
02:13:14,474 --> 02:13:15,395
... did injustice with you.

1375
02:13:17,477 --> 02:13:20,958
But, the respect that you
have given me, I had not ever...

1376
02:13:21,080 --> 02:13:22,923
... dreamt that you would.

1377
02:13:23,416 --> 02:13:27,136
The empire and rule of
lndia is now in your hands.

1378
02:13:28,588 --> 02:13:32,991
My rule had ended that day
itself when my husband and...

1379
02:13:33,092 --> 02:13:36,983
... emperor had passed away.

1380
02:13:38,731 --> 02:13:42,997
Now give me permission that
the last few days of my life...

1381
02:13:43,102 --> 02:13:45,969
... I spend at the
tomb of my husband.

1382
02:13:48,274 --> 02:13:49,935
This is my last wish.

1383
02:13:51,277 --> 02:13:53,120
The wish of Malika
Alam should be fulfilled.

1384
02:13:53,446 --> 02:13:54,947
As you say, your majesty!

1385
02:14:21,434 --> 02:14:25,996
So in this manner
many many years passed.

1386
02:14:26,606 --> 02:14:29,985
Suddenly in the life of the
Shehanshah who loved his...

1387
02:14:30,109 --> 02:14:34,000
... wife so much,
came a big storm.

1388
02:14:34,614 --> 02:14:38,664
A storm is coming!
A storm is coming!

1389
02:14:39,015 --> 02:14:43,759
O God, please have
mercy on my Mumtaz.

1390
02:14:54,497 --> 02:14:56,704
Emperor, if God wants
there will be good wishes and...

1391
02:14:56,866 --> 02:14:58,879
... congratulations all around.

1392
02:14:59,369 --> 02:15:00,768
There will be sounds
of happiness all around.

1393
02:15:01,504 --> 02:15:03,199
Congratulations Emperor, you
have got a beautiful daughter!

1394
02:15:03,373 --> 02:15:05,386
Congratulations!

1395
02:15:05,875 --> 02:15:08,742
God, thank you a thousand times!

1396
02:15:09,212 --> 02:15:10,713
Let there be celebrations
all around and the poor...

1397
02:15:10,880 --> 02:15:12,381
... should be given gifts.

1398
02:15:15,218 --> 02:15:16,207
What happened?.

1399
02:15:16,286 --> 02:15:19,084
Emperor, Empress is in
a very serious condition.

1400
02:15:25,528 --> 02:15:27,120
Mumtaz, I have come.

1401
02:15:31,320 --> 02:15:40,160
The time has come for me to go.

1402
02:15:40,462 --> 02:15:42,669
What are you saying, you
had promised to stay with...

1403
02:15:42,831 --> 02:15:44,674
... me all my life.

1404
02:15:45,167 --> 02:15:47,692
Don't leave me in the
middle of nowhere like this.

1405
02:15:48,470 --> 02:15:51,712
I will not let you go.
I will never let you go.

1406
02:15:53,475 --> 02:15:57,741
A shining moon, on the
shore of the river Jamuna, the...

1407
02:15:57,846 --> 02:16:02,761
... whole
atmosphere is so beautiful.

1408
02:16:04,353 --> 02:16:10,804
Prince, when I die
please make my tomb here.

1409
02:16:12,361 --> 02:16:13,692
You will make it won't you?.

1410
02:16:14,496 --> 02:16:21,834
Do not talk about dying!
I will die without you.

1411
02:16:23,205 --> 02:16:27,767
You will make it, won't you?.

1412
02:16:28,210 --> 02:16:31,748
I'll make a palace and I take
an oath on God you'll stay there.

1413
02:16:32,514 --> 02:16:35,756
You will see so much happiness
and you will see the river...

1414
02:16:35,884 --> 02:16:36,703
... flowing by, Mumtaz.

1415
02:16:41,523 --> 02:16:44,765
Open your eyes!
Mumtaz, open your eyes!

1416
02:17:07,249 --> 02:17:08,910
I will not let you go, Mumtaz!

1417
02:17:19,561 --> 02:17:22,803
Mumtaz Mahal has died
many days ago, while Emperor...

1418
02:17:22,931 --> 02:17:25,798
... has closed himself in
the Akbari palace for days now.

1419
02:17:26,268 --> 02:17:29,806
He doesn't meet anyone, nor
does he eat or drink anything.

1420
02:17:30,439 --> 02:17:32,282
God knows what is
happening with him.

1421
02:17:35,277 --> 02:17:39,839
- Who is there?. -
Prime minister, Asif Khan!

1422
02:17:40,382 --> 02:17:42,805
Go away! The door will not open.

1423
02:17:46,955 --> 02:17:47,944
Who is it?.

1424
02:17:48,524 --> 02:17:50,469
I am the unfortunate father
of the Arjuman Banoo who...

1425
02:17:50,526 --> 02:17:52,050
... is in heaven now.

1426
02:17:53,295 --> 02:17:54,796
Let the door be opened!

1427
02:18:12,314 --> 02:18:14,839
- Emperor! - What's the matter?.

1428
02:18:17,319 --> 02:18:18,468
What is the matter?.

1429
02:18:21,323 --> 02:18:26,909
Why are you so frightened?.
Have you forgotten me?.

1430
02:18:26,995 --> 02:18:31,978
Or is it that after Mumtaz
friends are no longer friends?.

1431
02:18:34,336 --> 02:18:41,640
After Mumtaz has my
glory and respect too gone.

1432
02:18:42,344 --> 02:18:44,005
May the emperor
have a long life!

1433
02:18:44,913 --> 02:18:49,930
Please forgive your subjects!
But Dil-E-Alahi, look at your face!

1434
02:18:51,520 --> 02:18:54,899
My face! What has
happened to my face?.

1435
02:19:05,367 --> 02:19:06,356
I am very happy.

1436
02:19:11,206 --> 02:19:14,585
I have gone white because
it is a symbol of my mourning.

1437
02:19:16,211 --> 02:19:17,200
A symbol of shock.

1438
02:19:18,380 --> 02:19:25,001
Mumtaz, I couldn't die in
sorrow for you but I know...

1439
02:19:25,053 --> 02:19:29,968
... that I have traversed
hundred years ahead in life.

1440
02:19:31,393 --> 02:19:33,566
Why did my funeral
not go along with yours?.

1441
02:19:39,741 --> 02:19:45,514
Emperor, be calm and
have patience otherwise...

1442
02:19:45,514 --> 02:19:49,336
... the empire will be lost.

1443
02:19:51,620 --> 02:19:54,999
When my life has got lost,
then who is scared of the...

1444
02:19:55,123 --> 02:19:57,478
... empire going away?.

1445
02:19:58,126 --> 02:20:00,481
Dil-E-Elahi have patience.
The traveler has gone...

1446
02:20:00,529 --> 02:20:02,986
... forever to that
destination from where...

1447
02:20:03,131 --> 02:20:04,280
... she will never come back.

1448
02:20:04,966 --> 02:20:07,321
Those who leave the world
and go, do not come back.

1449
02:20:09,037 --> 02:20:13,303
Why don't they come back?.
Why don't they come back?.

1450
02:20:39,087 --> 02:20:44,673
The promise that you have
made will have to be fulfilled.'

1451
02:20:45,327 --> 02:20:50,003
May the world stop
you or may God stop you.'

1452
02:20:50,098 --> 02:20:52,965
You will have to come.'

1453
02:21:12,454 --> 02:21:18,040
The whole world
tells me that no one..

1454
02:21:18,126 --> 02:21:24,065
..comes from the
land of the dead.'

1455
02:21:27,769 --> 02:21:32,035
Let the world see the
glory of loyalty today.'

1456
02:21:32,140 --> 02:21:37,055
You will have to come.'

1457
02:21:38,480 --> 02:21:44,066
The promise that you made,
you will have to fulfill it.'

1458
02:21:44,586 --> 02:21:49,569
I agree that we will
have to give up my life.'

1459
02:21:50,525 --> 02:21:55,030
understand this,
whenever you call..

1460
02:21:55,230 --> 02:21:58,028
..'me I will have to come.'

1461
02:21:59,334 --> 02:22:04,078
The promise that I have made,
I will have to fulfill it.'

1462
02:22:15,817 --> 02:22:21,107
I have been coming,
and I will continue coming.'

1463
02:22:22,023 --> 02:22:27,097
I will continue
completing the rituals of love.'

1464
02:22:31,032 --> 02:22:36,106
My loyal lover,
if you call me..'

1465
02:22:36,204 --> 02:22:41,119
..There is no other way,
I will have to come.'

1466
02:22:53,399 --> 02:22:58,143
You have to come Mumtaz.
You have kept your promise.

1467
02:22:59,572 --> 02:23:01,585
You have proved
that our love is eternal.

1468
02:23:02,875 --> 02:23:04,684
We can die but even then we
cannot be away from each other.

1469
02:23:07,620 --> 02:23:11,442
My dear, what is this
condition you have made of yours?.

1470
02:23:11,791 --> 02:23:14,407
I am burning deeply in my
sorrow, of being away from you.

1471
02:23:15,628 --> 02:23:17,471
I have become a heap
of ashes in your sorrow.

1472
02:23:19,632 --> 02:23:25,218
What sorrow! What separation!
I am dead for the world.

1473
02:23:26,472 --> 02:23:28,133
But, I am still alive for you.

1474
02:23:28,641 --> 02:23:34,227
See I am here. The same
shining moon, the same...

1475
02:23:34,313 --> 02:23:40,252
shore of the Yamuna river but
my dear, you are not the same.

1476
02:23:40,486 --> 02:23:42,772
- You have forgotten your
promise. - Which promise?.

1477
02:23:44,657 --> 02:23:49,572
The memory of our love.
The promise of our love.

1478
02:23:50,897 --> 02:23:57,553
My dear, till that palace
is not made I will be restless.

1479
02:23:59,645 --> 02:24:02,512
Mumtaz in your sorrow,
I forgot everything.

1480
02:24:03,649 --> 02:24:06,174
I forgot myself.
I forgot my promise.

1481
02:24:07,653 --> 02:24:10,178
I promise I will fulfill it.
Now, till I don't fulfill it l...

1482
02:24:10,322 --> 02:24:13,189
... will not rest, fulfilling
it will be the goal of my life.

1483
02:24:13,659 --> 02:24:16,184
It will be the
goal of my life Mumtaz.

1484
02:24:46,024 --> 02:24:51,314
Was it a Dream,
was all this a dream.

1485
02:24:54,566 --> 02:25:00,334
No she had come here.
My Mumtaz did come here.

1486
02:25:02,908 --> 02:25:04,239
She was sitting here with me.

1487
02:25:07,980 --> 02:25:12,098
Her voice is still
echoing in my ears.

1488
02:25:14,119 --> 02:25:18,488
The memory of love.
A palace of love.

1489
02:25:19,758 --> 02:25:24,058
Yes, that palace
will definitely be made.

1490
02:25:24,763 --> 02:25:25,912
That palace will be made Mumtaz!

1491
02:25:33,005 --> 02:25:36,315
Emperor the artisan who makes
this palace will see that it...

1492
02:25:36,441 --> 02:25:39,308
... conforms with the
greatness of Empress in every way.

1493
02:25:40,612 --> 02:25:47,916
The palace will be adorned with
jewels and domes reaching the sky.

1494
02:25:48,086 --> 02:25:50,099
Diamonds will sparkle from it.

1495
02:25:51,790 --> 02:25:55,612
I do not want a palace which is
adorned with jewels and diamonds.

1496
02:25:56,094 --> 02:25:59,336
I want a palace in which my
emotions, and not my wealth...

1497
02:25:59,464 --> 02:26:03,355
... is depicted. I want
my love to be seen in that.

1498
02:26:03,802 --> 02:26:07,852
Why are you quiet?. The
Shah of lran has praised...

1499
02:26:07,873 --> 02:26:10,740
... your work a lot, you
too give your suggestions.

1500
02:26:11,043 --> 02:26:15,093
Dil-E-Elahi, I am
Shirazi a poor artisan...

1501
02:26:15,113 --> 02:26:18,355
and I cannot think
about diamonds and jewels.

1502
02:26:18,817 --> 02:26:21,342
The design which I have
in mind is very simple and...

1503
02:26:21,486 --> 02:26:24,353
... different from the rest.

1504
02:26:25,057 --> 02:26:28,367
This is what I want, l
want the Taj to be different...

1505
02:26:28,493 --> 02:26:32,384
from the rest and the
most unusual of the lot.

1506
02:26:33,131 --> 02:26:39,957
That palace will
be carved of marble.

1507
02:26:40,505 --> 02:26:44,396
Yes! Which will
have such fragrance!

1508
02:26:44,843 --> 02:26:49,917
That will in moonlit nights
make the hearts of lovers yearn.

1509
02:26:50,148 --> 02:26:58,510
In which, beauty
will speak for itself.

1510
02:26:58,757 --> 02:27:01,794
When that palace gets
ready then in the whole world...

1511
02:27:01,827 --> 02:27:05,069
... the light of
love will spread.

1512
02:27:05,163 --> 02:27:10,965
Shirazi, you are not an
artisan but a magician.

1513
02:27:11,536 --> 02:27:14,915
You have said, what I have
felt you have stolen my dreams.

1514
02:27:16,041 --> 02:27:19,420
I and Mumtaz had together
seen this dream of such a palace...

1515
02:27:19,544 --> 02:27:22,411
... near the
shore of the Yamuna.

1516
02:27:22,983 --> 02:27:27,249
Go Shirazi, and as soon
as possible make this palace!

1517
02:27:27,988 --> 02:27:32,254
Mumtaz is
restless desperate for it.

1518
02:27:33,928 --> 02:27:41,061
It is a memory of our love.
The palace of love.

1519
02:27:48,277 --> 02:27:52,543
The shore of the Yamuna and
this loneliness around it,...

1520
02:27:52,648 --> 02:27:57,563
... my beloved husband.

1521
02:27:58,087 --> 02:28:07,689
Mumtaz is thinking of me. She
is calling out to me for years.

1522
02:28:09,999 --> 02:28:12,103
I will have to go.

1523
02:28:15,044 --> 02:28:26,785
I want to see the Taj Mahal.
Take me to Mumtaz!

1524
02:28:27,223 --> 02:28:29,578
As you say, Lord!

1525
02:28:30,059 --> 02:28:33,597
Take me to her! Take me to her!

1526
02:29:06,329 --> 02:29:07,591
Beautiful!

1527
02:29:10,059 --> 02:29:15,929
The shore of Yamuna!
The foundation of love!

1528
02:29:18,234 --> 02:29:19,565
The palace of love!

1529
02:29:22,071 --> 02:29:24,596
The goal of my life is over.

1530
02:29:31,080 --> 02:29:37,701
I feel lonely
without you, Mumtaz.

1531
02:29:38,187 --> 02:29:43,682
The promise that you have
done, you will have to fulfill it.'

1532
02:29:44,393 --> 02:29:51,731
May the world stop you,
or may God himself stop you.'

1533
02:29:58,941 --> 02:30:03,685
It is agreed that I will
have to give up my life.'

1534
02:30:04,613 --> 02:30:12,088
Understand this, whenever
you call, I will have to come.'

1535
02:30:27,370 --> 02:30:39,248
My story is your legend. It
will remembered by the world.'

1536
02:30:42,151 --> 02:30:45,689
What accusation
and what punishment??'

1537
02:30:46,155 --> 02:30:50,717
I will have to come.'

1538
02:30:51,994 --> 02:30:56,738
The promise that we have made,
we will have to fulfill it.'

1539
02:30:57,666 --> 02:31:02,740
May the world stop us,
or may God himself stop us.'
